      "html": "<style>\n    @import url('https://fonts.googleapis.com/css2?family=Inter:wght@400;500;600;700;800&family=JetBrains+Mono:wght@500;600;700&display=swap');\n  .sy-login{font-family:Inter,ui-sans-serif,system-ui,sans-serif;background:#08121D;color:#EDF5F8;min-height:100vh}\n  .sy-login button,.sy-login input{font:inherit}\n  .sy-login .mono{font-family:'JetBrains Mono',ui-monospace,monospace}\n  .sy-login .label{font-size:10px;line-height:1.2;letter-spacing:.14em;text-transform:uppercase;font-weight:800;color:#7F95A5}\n  .sy-login .line{border-color:#29465C}\n  .sy-login .focusable:focus-visible{outline:2px solid #1BD1A5;outline-offset:3px}\n  .sy-login .role.active{border-color:#1BD1A5;background:rgba(27,209,165,.1)}\n  .sy-login .role.active .role-icon{color:#1BD1A5;border-color:rgba(27,209,165,.45);background:rgba(27,209,165,.1)}\n</style>\n<div class=\"sy-login px-4 pb-8 pt-4 sm:px-5\" data-kid=\"1\" data-name=\"login page wrapper\">\n    <header class=\"flex items-center justify-between border-b line pb-4\" data-kid=\"1-1\" data-name=\"header container\">\n        <div class=\"flex items-center gap-3\" data-kid=\"1-1-1\" data-name=\"brand logo area\">\n            <div class=\"grid h-10 w-10 place-items-center rounded-[10px] border border-[#1BD1A5]/45 bg-[#1BD1A5]/10 text-[#1BD1A5]\" data-kid=\"1-1-1-1\" data-name=\"shield icon container\">\n                <i class=\"h-5 w-5\" data-kid=\"1-1-1-1-1\" data-lucide=\"shield-check\" data-name=\"shield-check icon\">\n                </i>\n            </div>\n            <div data-kid=\"1-1-1-2\" data-name=\"brand name and tagline container\">\n                <p class=\"text-[15px] font-extrabold tracking-[-.03em] text-white\" data-kid=\"1-1-1-2-1\" data-name=\"brand name text\">\n                    SafeYatra\n                    <span class=\"text-[#1BD1A5]\" data-kid=\"1-1-1-2-1-1\" data-name=\"brand name AI suffix\">\n                        AI\n                    </span>\n                </p>\n                <p class=\"label mt-1\" data-kid=\"1-1-1-2-2\" data-name=\"brand tagline text\">\n                    Tourist safety network\n                </p>\n            </div>\n        </div>\n        <div class=\"flex items-center gap-2 text-[10px] font-bold text-[#8FEAD3]\" data-kid=\"1-1-2\" data-name=\"connection status badge\">\n            <span class=\"h-2 w-2 rounded-full bg-[#1BD1A5]\" data-kid=\"1-1-2-1\" data-name=\"connection indicator dot\">\n            </span>\n            Local ready\n        </div>\n    </header>\n    <main class=\"pt-7\" data-kid=\"1-2\" data-name=\"main content area\">\n        <section data-kid=\"1-2-1\" data-name=\"login header section\">\n            <p class=\"label text-[#1BD1A5]\" data-kid=\"1-2-1-1\" data-name=\"access label\">\n                Protected access\n            </p>\n            <h1 class=\"mt-2 text-[29px] font-extrabold leading-[1.07] tracking-[-.045em] text-white\" data-kid=\"1-2-1-2\" data-name=\"login headline text\">\n                Enter your\n                <br data-kid=\"1-2-1-2-1\" data-name=\"headline line break\"/>\n                safety workspace.\n            </h1>\n            <p class=\"mt-3 max-w-[320px] text-[13px] leading-5 text-[#AFC0CA]\" data-kid=\"1-2-1-3\" data-name=\"login description text\">\n                Sign in to monitor a journey, coordinate a response, or manage the safety network.\n            </p>\n        </section>\n        <section class=\"mt-6 rounded-[10px] border line bg-[#0E1D2C] p-4\" data-kid=\"1-2-2\" data-name=\"login form section\">\n            <div class=\"flex items-center justify-between\" data-kid=\"1-2-2-1\" data-name=\"form header container\">\n                <div data-kid=\"1-2-2-1-1\" data-name=\"form title text container\">\n                    <p class=\"label\" data-kid=\"1-2-2-1-1-1\" data-name=\"form label\">\n                        Sign in\n                    </p>\n                    <p class=\"mt-1 text-[13px] font-semibold text-white\" data-kid=\"1-2-2-1-1-2\" data-name=\"form instruction text\">\n                        Use a demo account to continue\n                    </p>\n                </div>\n                <span class=\"mono rounded-full border border-[#5AA7FF]/35 bg-[#5AA7FF]/10 px-2 py-1 text-[9px] font-bold text-[#9CC7FF]\" data-kid=\"1-2-2-1-2\" data-name=\"demo badge\">\n                    DEMO\n                </span>\n            </div>\n            <form class=\"mt-5 space-y-4\" data-kid=\"1-2-2-2\" data-name=\"login form\" id=\"login-form\">\n                <label class=\"block\" data-kid=\"1-2-2-2-1\" data-name=\"email field container\">\n                    <span class=\"mb-2 block text-[12px] font-bold text-[#D7E4E9]\" data-kid=\"1-2-2-2-1-1\" data-name=\"email label\">\n                        Email address\n                    </span>\n                    <div class=\"relative\" data-kid=\"1-2-2-2-1-2\" data-name=\"email input wrapper\">\n                        <i class=\"pointer-events-none absolute left-3 top-1/2 h-4 w-4 -translate-y-1/2 text-[#7F95A5]\" data-kid=\"1-2-2-2-1-2-1\" data-lucide=\"mail\" data-name=\"email icon\">\n                        </i>\n                        <input aria-label=\"Email address\" class=\"focusable h-12 w-full rounded-[8px] border line bg-[#08121D] pl-10 pr-3 text-[13px] text-white outline-none placeholder:text-[#647887]\" data-dynamic=\"true\" data-kid=\"1-2-2-2-1-2-2\" data-name=\"email input field\" data-reason=\"value replaced when role button is clicked\" id=\"email\" type=\"email\" value=\"tourist@safeyatra.com\"/>\n                    </div>\n                </label>\n                <label class=\"block\" data-kid=\"1-2-2-2-2\" data-name=\"password field container\">\n                    <span class=\"mb-2 block text-[12px] font-bold text-[#D7E4E9]\" data-kid=\"1-2-2-2-2-1\" data-name=\"password label\">\n                        Password\n                    </span>\n                    <div class=\"relative\" data-kid=\"1-2-2-2-2-2\" data-name=\"password input wrapper\">\n                        <i class=\"pointer-events-none absolute left-3 top-1/2 h-4 w-4 -translate-y-1/2 text-[#7F95A5]\" data-kid=\"1-2-2-2-2-2-1\" data-lucide=\"key-round\" data-name=\"password icon\">\n                        </i>\n                        <input aria-label=\"Password\" class=\"focusable h-12 w-full rounded-[8px] border line bg-[#08121D] pl-10 pr-12 text-[13px] text-white outline-none placeholder:text-[#647887]\" data-dynamic=\"true\" data-kid=\"1-2-2-2-2-2-2\" data-name=\"password input field\" data-reason=\"value replaced when role button is clicked\" id=\"password\" type=\"password\" value=\"tour123\"/>\n                        <button aria-label=\"Show password\" class=\"focusable absolute right-2 top-1/2 grid h-10 w-10 -translate-y-1/2 place-items-center rounded-[8px] text-[#8DA4B2] hover:bg-white/[.05] hover:text-white\" data-dynamic=\"true\" data-kid=\"1-2-2-2-2-2-3\" data-name=\"toggle password visibility button\" data-reason=\"aria-label, inner icon and type attribute toggled by script\" id=\"toggle-password\" type=\"button\">\n                            <i class=\"h-4 w-4\" data-dynamic=\"true\" data-kid=\"1-2-2-2-2-2-3-1\" data-lucide=\"eye\" data-name=\"password visibility toggle icon\" data-reason=\"icon element replaced by lucide script\">\n                            </i>\n                        </button>\n                    </div>\n                </label>\n                <button class=\"focusable flex min-h-12 w-full items-center justify-center gap-2 rounded-[8px] bg-[#1BD1A5] px-4 text-[13px] font-extrabold text-[#08121D] hover:bg-[#8FEAD3]\" data-kid=\"1-2-2-2-3\" data-name=\"sign-in submit button\" id=\"signin\" type=\"submit\">\n                    <span data-kid=\"1-2-2-2-3-1\" data-name=\"submit button text\">\n                        Sign in securely\n                    </span>\n                    <i class=\"h-4 w-4\" data-kid=\"1-2-2-2-3-2\" data-lucide=\"arrow-right\" data-name=\"submit arrow icon\">\n                    </i>\n                </button>\n                <div class=\"hidden rounded-[8px] border border-[#1BD1A5]/30 bg-[#1BD1A5]/10 px-3 py-2.5 text-[12px] leading-4 text-[#9BEBD8]\" data-dynamic=\"true\" data-kid=\"1-2-2-2-4\" data-name=\"form feedback message container\" data-reason=\"text content, border, and background color set by script\" id=\"form-feedback\" role=\"status\">\n                </div>\n            </form>\n            <div class=\"mt-4 flex items-center justify-between gap-3 border-t line pt-4\" data-kid=\"1-2-2-3\" data-name=\"offline access section\">\n                <button class=\"focusable inline-flex min-h-11 items-center gap-2 text-[12px] font-bold text-[#B9C8D0] hover:text-white\" data-kid=\"1-2-2-3-1\" data-name=\"offline access button\" id=\"offline-login\" type=\"button\">\n                    <i class=\"h-4 w-4 text-[#E7B84B]\" data-kid=\"1-2-2-3-1-1\" data-lucide=\"wifi-off\" data-name=\"wifi-off icon\">\n                    </i>\n                    Continue offline\n                </button>\n                <span class=\"text-right text-[11px] leading-4 text-[#7F95A5]\" data-kid=\"1-2-2-3-2\" data-name=\"offline info text\">\n                    Local queue stays\n                    <br data-kid=\"1-2-2-3-2-1\" data-name=\"offline info line break\"/>\n                    available without signal.\n                </span>\n            </div>\n        </section>\n        <section class=\"mt-6\" data-kid=\"1-2-3\" data-name=\"role selection section\">\n            <div class=\"flex items-end justify-between gap-3\" data-kid=\"1-2-3-1\" data-name=\"role header container\">\n                <div data-kid=\"1-2-3-1-1\" data-name=\"role title container\">\n                    <p class=\"label text-[#5AA7FF]\" data-kid=\"1-2-3-1-1-1\" data-name=\"role label\">\n                        Demo access\n                    </p>\n                    <h2 class=\"mt-1 text-[17px] font-extrabold text-white\" data-kid=\"1-2-3-1-1-2\" data-name=\"role selection title\">\n                        Choose a role\n                    </h2>\n                </div>\n                <span class=\"text-[11px] text-[#7F95A5]\" data-kid=\"1-2-3-1-2\" data-name=\"role selection hint\">\n                    Tap to fill\n                </span>\n            </div>\n            <div class=\"mt-3 grid grid-cols-2 gap-2\" data-kid=\"1-2-3-2\" data-name=\"role options grid\">\n                <button class=\"role active focusable rounded-[10px] border line bg-[#0E1D2C] p-3 text-left hover:border-[#1BD1A5]/60\" data-dynamic=\"true\" data-email=\"tourist@safeyatra.com\" data-kid=\"1-2-3-2-1\" data-name=\"tourist role selection button\" data-password=\"tour123\" data-reason=\"active class toggled, input values updated by script\" data-role=\"tourist\" type=\"button\">\n                    <span class=\"role-icon grid h-9 w-9 place-items-center rounded-[8px] border line bg-[#08121D] text-[#1BD1A5]\" data-kid=\"1-2-3-2-1-1\" data-name=\"tourist role icon container\">\n                        <i class=\"h-4 w-4\" data-kid=\"1-2-3-2-1-1-1\" data-lucide=\"map-pinned\" data-name=\"tourist icon\">\n                        </i>\n                    </span>\n                    <span class=\"mt-3 block text-[12px] font-extrabold text-white\" data-kid=\"1-2-3-2-1-2\" data-name=\"tourist role title\">\n                        Tourist\n                    </span>\n                    <span class=\"mt-1 block truncate text-[11px] text-[#8FA4B1]\" data-kid=\"1-2-3-2-1-3\" data-name=\"tourist role name\">\n                        Aarav Mehta\n                    </span>\n                </button>\n                <button class=\"role focusable rounded-[10px] border line bg-[#0E1D2C] p-3 text-left hover:border-[#5AA7FF]/60\" data-dynamic=\"true\" data-email=\"auth@safeyatra.com\" data-kid=\"1-2-3-2-2\" data-name=\"authority role selection button\" data-password=\"auth123\" data-reason=\"active class toggled, input values updated by script\" data-role=\"authority\" type=\"button\">\n                    <span class=\"role-icon grid h-9 w-9 place-items-center rounded-[8px] border line bg-[#08121D] text-[#5AA7FF]\" data-kid=\"1-2-3-2-2-1\" data-name=\"authority role icon container\">\n                        <i class=\"h-4 w-4\" data-kid=\"1-2-3-2-2-1-1\" data-lucide=\"radar\" data-name=\"authority icon\">\n                        </i>\n                    </span>\n                    <span class=\"mt-3 block text-[12px] font-extrabold text-white\" data-kid=\"1-2-3-2-2-2\" data-name=\"authority role title\">\n                        Authority\n                    </span>\n                    <span class=\"mt-1 block truncate text-[11px] text-[#8FA4B1]\" data-kid=\"1-2-3-2-2-3\" data-name=\"authority role name\">\n                        Nashik Control Room\n                    </span>\n                </button>\n                <button class=\"role focusable rounded-[10px] border line bg-[#0E1D2C] p-3 text-left hover:border-[#E7B84B]/60\" data-dynamic=\"true\" data-email=\"resp@safeyatra.com\" data-kid=\"1-2-3-2-3\" data-name=\"responder role selection button\" data-password=\"resp123\" data-reason=\"active class toggled, input values updated by script\" data-role=\"responder\" type=\"button\">\n                    <span class=\"role-icon grid h-9 w-9 place-items-center rounded-[8px] border line bg-[#08121D] text-[#E7B84B]\" data-kid=\"1-2-3-2-3-1\" data-name=\"responder role icon container\">\n                        <i class=\"h-4 w-4\" data-kid=\"1-2-3-2-3-1-1\" data-lucide=\"siren\" data-name=\"responder icon\">\n                        </i>\n                    </span>\n                    <span class=\"mt-3 block text-[12px] font-extrabold text-white\" data-kid=\"1-2-3-2-3-2\" data-name=\"responder role title\">\n                        Responder\n                    </span>\n                    <span class=\"mt-1 block truncate text-[11px] text-[#8FA4B1]\" data-kid=\"1-2-3-2-3-3\" data-name=\"responder role name\">\n                        Ravi Patil\n                    </span>\n                </button>\n                <button class=\"role focusable rounded-[10px] border line bg-[#0E1D2C] p-3 text-left hover:border-[#FF6870]/60\" data-dynamic=\"true\" data-email=\"admin@safeyatra.com\" data-kid=\"1-2-3-2-4\" data-name=\"admin role selection button\" data-password=\"admin123\" data-reason=\"active class toggled, input values updated by script\" data-role=\"admin\" type=\"button\">\n                    <span class=\"role-icon grid h-9 w-9 place-items-center rounded-[8px] border line bg-[#08121D] text-[#FF6870]\" data-kid=\"1-2-3-2-4-1\" data-name=\"admin role icon container\">\n                        <i class=\"h-4 w-4\" data-kid=\"1-2-3-2-4-1-1\" data-lucide=\"settings-2\" data-name=\"admin icon\">\n                        </i>\n                    </span>\n                    <span class=\"mt-3 block text-[12px] font-extrabold text-white\" data-kid=\"1-2-3-2-4-2\" data-name=\"admin role title\">\n                        Admin\n                    </span>\n                    <span class=\"mt-1 block truncate text-[11px] text-[#8FA4B1]\" data-kid=\"1-2-3-2-4-3\" data-name=\"admin role name\">\n                        System Administrator\n                    </span>\n                </button>\n            </div>\n        </section>\n        <aside class=\"mt-6 rounded-[10px] border border-[#E7B84B]/30 bg-[#E7B84B]/[.07] p-3.5\" data-kid=\"1-2-4\" data-name=\"offline alert card\">\n            <div class=\"flex items-start gap-3\" data-kid=\"1-2-4-1\" data-name=\"alert content container\">\n                <i class=\"mt-0.5 h-4 w-4 shrink-0 text-[#E7B84B]\" data-kid=\"1-2-4-1-1\" data-lucide=\"hard-drive-download\" data-name=\"offline icon\">\n                </i>\n                <div data-kid=\"1-2-4-1-2\" data-name=\"alert text container\">\n                    <p class=\"text-[12px] font-extrabold text-[#FFE8A3]\" data-kid=\"1-2-4-1-2-1\" data-name=\"alert title\">\n                        Offline-first protection\n                    </p>\n                    <p class=\"mt-1 text-[11px] leading-4 text-[#D1C28F]\" data-kid=\"1-2-4-1-2-2\" data-name=\"alert body text\">\n                        GPS, geo-fencing, AI risk detection and SOS creation continue locally. Pending events sync automatically when the network returns.\n                    </p>\n                </div>\n            </div>\n        </aside>\n        <p class=\"mt-5 text-center text-[10px] text-[#647887]\" data-kid=\"1-2-5\" data-name=\"footer version info text\">\n            <span class=\"mono\" data-kid=\"1-2-5-1\" data-name=\"version code string\">\n                SAFEYATRA / ACCESS CONTROL\n            </span>\n            · v1.0 demo environment\n        </p>\n    </main>\n</div>\n<script src=\"https://unpkg.com/lucide@latest\">\n</script>\n<script>\n    lucide.createIcons();\n  const email = document.getElementById('email');\n  const password = document.getElementById('password');\n  const feedback = document.getElementById('form-feedback');\n  const show = (message, tone) => { feedback.textContent = message; feedback.classList.remove('hidden'); feedback.style.borderColor = tone === 'warn' ? 'rgba(231,184,75,.35)' : 'rgba(27,209,165,.3)'; feedback.style.background = tone === 'warn' ? 'rgba(231,184,75,.08)' : 'rgba(27,209,165,.1)'; window.clearTimeout(window.__feedbackTimer); window.__feedbackTimer = window.setTimeout(() => feedback.classList.add('hidden'), 4200); };\n  document.querySelectorAll('.role').forEach((button) => button.addEventListener('click', () => { document.querySelectorAll('.role').forEach((item) => item.classList.remove('active')); button.classList.add('active'); email.value = button.dataset.email; password.value = button.dataset.password; show(button.dataset.role[0].toUpperCase() + button.dataset.role.slice(1) + ' demo account loaded.', 'good'); }));\n  document.getElementById('toggle-password').addEventListener('click', (event) => { const input = password; input.type = input.type === 'password' ? 'text' : 'password'; event.currentTarget.setAttribute('aria-label', input.type === 'password' ? 'Show password' : 'Hide password'); event.currentTarget.innerHTML = '<i data-lucide=\"' + (input.type === 'password' ? 'eye' : 'eye-off') + '\" class=\"h-4 w-4\"></i>'; lucide.createIcons(); });\n  document.getElementById('login-form').addEventListener('submit', (event) => { event.preventDefault(); show('Credentials accepted. Opening the selected safety workspace…', 'good'); });\n  document.getElementById('offline-login').addEventListener('click', () => show('Offline access enabled. Local workspace and SOS remain available.', 'warn'));\n</script>\n",
      "comments": [],
      "created": "2026-07-26T05:40:03.208156+00:00",
      "modified": "2026-07-26T05:41:00.751031+00:00",
      "id": "var_e22658e35a3b"
    },
    "var_146c69bfb2e9": {
      "type": "variant",
      "label": "Responder Dashboard · High Alert",
      "parentId": null,
      "themeId": null,
      "rect": {
        "x": 9705,
        "y": 0,
        "w": 1280,
        "h": 800
      },
      "html": "<style>\n    @import url('https://fonts.googleapis.com/css2?family=Inter:wght@400;500;600;700;800&family=JetBrains+Mono:wght@500;600;700&display=swap');\n  .sy-wrap{--ink:#08121D;--slate:#0E1D2C;--elevated:#152A3D;--line:#29465C;--muted:#9AAEBC;--text:#EDF5F8;--mint:#1BD1A5;--cyan:#5AA7FF;--amber:#E7B84B;--coral:#FF6870;background:var(--ink);color:var(--text);font-family:Inter,ui-sans-serif,system-ui,sans-serif;min-height:100vh}\n  .sy-wrap *{box-sizing:border-box}\n  .sy-wrap button{font:inherit}\n  .mono{font-family:'JetBrains Mono',ui-monospace,SFMono-Regular,monospace}\n  .topbar{display:flex;align-items:center;justify-content:space-between;gap:18px;padding:16px 28px;border-bottom:1px solid var(--line);background:#091622;position:sticky;top:0;z-index:5}\n  .brand{display:flex;align-items:center;gap:11px;min-width:190px}.brand-mark{width:34px;height:34px;display:grid;place-items:center;border:1px solid rgba(27,209,165,.5);color:var(--mint);background:rgba(27,209,165,.07);border-radius:9px}.brand-copy{line-height:1.05}.brand-name{font-size:14px;font-weight:800;letter-spacing:-.02em}.brand-name span{color:var(--mint)}.brand-sub{margin-top:5px;color:#75909f;text-transform:uppercase;letter-spacing:.14em;font-size:9px;font-weight:700}\n  .unit-meta{display:flex;align-items:center;gap:12px;flex:1}.crumb{font-size:11px;color:#78909f}.crumb strong{color:var(--text);font-weight:700}.live-pill{display:flex;align-items:center;gap:7px;border:1px solid rgba(27,209,165,.35);color:#86e7cf;background:rgba(27,209,165,.08);padding:8px 10px;border-radius:7px;font-size:10px;font-weight:800;letter-spacing:.06em;text-transform:uppercase}.dot{width:7px;height:7px;border-radius:50%;background:var(--mint);box-shadow:0 0 0 4px rgba(27,209,165,.12)}\n  .operator{display:flex;align-items:center;gap:10px;border-left:1px solid var(--line);padding-left:18px}.avatar{width:34px;height:34px;border:1px solid rgba(90,167,255,.45);background:rgba(90,167,255,.12);color:#b9d7ff;display:grid;place-items:center;border-radius:9px;font-weight:800;font-size:11px}.operator strong{display:block;font-size:11px}.operator span{display:block;color:#7d93a1;font-size:10px;margin-top:3px}\n  .critical-banner{margin:18px 28px 0;border:1px solid rgba(255,104,112,.52);background:#26191f;display:flex;align-items:center;justify-content:space-between;gap:20px;padding:15px 17px;border-radius:10px}.critical-left{display:flex;align-items:center;gap:12px}.critical-icon{width:36px;height:36px;display:grid;place-items:center;border-radius:9px;color:#ffd5d7;background:rgba(255,104,112,.16)}.eyebrow{font-size:10px;text-transform:uppercase;letter-spacing:.14em;font-weight:800;color:#7e99a8}.critical-banner h1{font-size:15px;margin:4px 0 0;letter-spacing:-.02em}.critical-banner p{margin:4px 0 0;color:#b9a0a5;font-size:11px}.critical-right{display:flex;align-items:center;gap:12px;flex-wrap:wrap;justify-content:flex-end}.critical-right .mono{font-size:11px;color:#ffd0d3}.alert-status{border:1px solid rgba(255,104,112,.45);color:#ffd0d3;background:rgba(255,104,112,.11);padding:8px 10px;border-radius:7px;font-size:10px;font-weight:800;text-transform:uppercase;letter-spacing:.08em}\n  .page{max-width:1600px;margin:0 auto;padding:20px 28px 42px}.headline{display:flex;align-items:end;justify-content:space-between;gap:20px;margin:5px 0 16px}.headline h2{font-size:26px;line-height:1.1;letter-spacing:-.04em;margin:7px 0 0}.headline p{max-width:570px;color:var(--muted);font-size:12px;line-height:1.6;margin:7px 0 0}.sync-note{display:flex;align-items:center;gap:8px;border:1px solid rgba(231,184,75,.3);background:rgba(231,184,75,.08);color:#f4d98c;border-radius:8px;padding:10px 12px;font-size:11px;white-space:nowrap}.sync-note i{width:15px;height:15px}\n  .kpis{display:grid;grid-template-columns:repeat(4,1fr);gap:10px;margin-bottom:14px}.kpi{border:1px solid var(--line);background:var(--slate);border-radius:9px;padding:13px 14px;min-height:85px}.kpi-label{font-size:10px;text-transform:uppercase;letter-spacing:.1em;color:#78909f;font-weight:800}.kpi-value{margin-top:9px;font-size:22px;line-height:1;font-weight:800;letter-spacing:-.04em}.kpi-detail{margin-top:7px;color:#8da3b0;font-size:10px}.kpi.critical{border-color:rgba(255,104,112,.42);background:#21191f}.kpi.critical .kpi-value{color:#ffd2d5}.kpi.info .kpi-value{color:#b9d8ff}.kpi.safe .kpi-value{color:#a0f2df}.kpi.caution .kpi-value{color:#f4d98c}\n  .workgrid{display:grid;grid-template-columns:280px minmax(430px,1fr) 330px;gap:12px;align-items:stretch}.panel{border:1px solid var(--line);background:var(--slate);border-radius:10px;min-width:0}.panel-head{display:flex;justify-content:space-between;align-items:start;gap:10px;padding:15px 15px 12px;border-bottom:1px solid var(--line)}.panel-title{font-size:13px;font-weight:800;letter-spacing:-.015em;margin-top:4px}.panel-meta{font-size:10px;color:#78909f;margin-top:4px}.count{font-size:10px;color:#ffd2d5;background:rgba(255,104,112,.12);border:1px solid rgba(255,104,112,.3);padding:5px 7px;border-radius:6px;font-weight:800}\n  .queue{padding:9px}.queue-item{display:block;width:100%;text-align:left;border:1px solid transparent;background:transparent;color:var(--text);padding:12px 10px;border-radius:8px;cursor:pointer;margin-bottom:5px}.queue-item:hover{border-color:rgba(90,167,255,.35);background:rgba(90,167,255,.06)}.queue-item.active{border-color:rgba(255,104,112,.54);background:rgba(255,104,112,.1)}.queue-row{display:flex;justify-content:space-between;align-items:center;gap:7px}.queue-id{font-size:10px;color:#a7c8ed}.queue-time{font-size:9px;color:#78909f}.queue-name{font-size:12px;font-weight:800;margin-top:8px}.queue-reason{font-size:10px;line-height:1.45;color:#9eafb9;margin-top:5px}.queue-tags{display:flex;align-items:center;gap:6px;margin-top:9px}.tag{font-size:9px;font-weight:800;letter-spacing:.08em;text-transform:uppercase;padding:4px 6px;border-radius:5px;border:1px solid var(--line);color:#aabcc7}.tag.critical{border-color:rgba(255,104,112,.46);color:#ffd2d5;background:rgba(255,104,112,.08)}.tag.cyan{border-color:rgba(90,167,255,.42);color:#c2dcff;background:rgba(90,167,255,.08)}.queue-footer{border-top:1px solid var(--line);padding:12px 10px 4px;color:#78909f;font-size:10px;line-height:1.5}.queue-footer strong{color:#b6c9d3}\n  .map-panel{overflow:hidden}.map-wrap{padding:10px}.map{height:463px;border:1px solid #31536a;border-radius:8px;position:relative;overflow:hidden;background:#112736}.map:before,.map:after{content:'';position:absolute;inset:0;pointer-events:none}.map:before{background:linear-gradient(136deg,transparent 0 29%,rgba(90,167,255,.13) 29.2% 29.6%,transparent 29.8% 49%,rgba(27,209,165,.12) 49.2% 49.6%,transparent 49.8% 70%,rgba(90,167,255,.12) 70.2% 70.6%,transparent 70.8%);opacity:.9}.map:after{background:linear-gradient(28deg,transparent 0 36%,rgba(255,255,255,.08) 36.2% 36.5%,transparent 36.7% 74%,rgba(255,255,255,.06) 74.2% 74.5%,transparent 74.7%)}.road{position:absolute;height:2px;background:#3c6175;transform-origin:left center;opacity:.8;z-index:1}.road.r1{width:85%;left:2%;top:72%;transform:rotate(-24deg)}.road.r2{width:70%;left:19%;top:48%;transform:rotate(27deg)}.road.r3{width:58%;left:35%;top:82%;transform:rotate(-58deg)}.road.r4{width:60%;left:7%;top:26%;transform:rotate(12deg)}.zone{position:absolute;border-radius:50%;z-index:2}.zone.safe{width:180px;height:180px;left:9%;top:15%;border:1px solid rgba(27,209,165,.48);background:rgba(27,209,165,.12)}.zone.caution{width:230px;height:160px;right:12%;top:42%;border:1px solid rgba(231,184,75,.52);background:rgba(231,184,75,.1);transform:rotate(-20deg)}.zone.danger{width:190px;height:190px;right:9%;top:9%;border:1px solid rgba(255,104,112,.65);background:rgba(255,104,112,.16)}.zone-label{position:absolute;z-index:3;font-size:9px;font-weight:800;letter-spacing:.08em;text-transform:uppercase}.safe-label{left:13%;top:20%;color:#7ce8cc}.caution-label{right:18%;top:60%;color:#f2d583}.danger-label{right:17%;top:18%;color:#ffc1c5}.route{position:absolute;left:18%;top:73%;width:64%;height:2px;background:var(--cyan);z-index:4;transform:rotate(-31deg);transform-origin:left center;box-shadow:0 0 0 4px rgba(90,167,255,.08)}.route:after{content:'';position:absolute;right:-2px;top:-4px;width:10px;height:10px;border-radius:50%;background:var(--coral);box-shadow:0 0 0 5px rgba(255,104,112,.16)}.map-marker{position:absolute;z-index:5;display:grid;place-items:center;width:28px;height:28px;border-radius:50%;font-size:11px}.start{left:15%;top:70%;color:#08121d;background:var(--cyan);box-shadow:0 0 0 5px rgba(90,167,255,.14)}.target{right:21%;top:17%;color:#fff;background:var(--coral);box-shadow:0 0 0 7px rgba(255,104,112,.16),0 0 0 14px rgba(255,104,112,.07)}.tourist-label{position:absolute;z-index:6;right:5%;top:25%;font-size:10px;font-weight:800;color:#ffd2d5;background:#26191f;border:1px solid rgba(255,104,112,.4);padding:6px 7px;border-radius:6px}.map-legend{position:absolute;left:14px;bottom:12px;z-index:6;display:flex;flex-wrap:wrap;gap:8px;background:rgba(8,18,29,.9);border:1px solid #345365;padding:8px;border-radius:7px}.legend-item{display:flex;align-items:center;gap:5px;font-size:9px;color:#bbcad1}.legend-dot{width:7px;height:7px;border-radius:50%}.map-footer{display:flex;justify-content:space-between;gap:12px;padding:10px 2px 3px;color:#8da3b0;font-size:10px}.map-footer strong{color:#d4e5eb}.fallback{margin:0 10px 10px;border:1px dashed rgba(231,184,75,.38);background:rgba(231,184,75,.06);color:#c9b374;border-radius:7px;padding:9px 10px;font-size:10px;line-height:1.45}.fallback strong{color:#f1d989}\n  .dispatch{padding:15px}.risk-summary{border:1px solid rgba(255,104,112,.45);background:#24191f;border-radius:8px;padding:13px}.risk-line{display:flex;align-items:end;justify-content:space-between;gap:10px}.risk-score{font-size:36px;line-height:1;font-weight:800;letter-spacing:-.05em;color:#ffd2d5}.risk-score small{font-size:14px;letter-spacing:0;color:#db8d94}.risk-level{font-size:10px;font-weight:800;color:#ffd2d5;text-transform:uppercase;letter-spacing:.12em}.risk-desc{margin-top:9px;color:#c7a8ad;font-size:10px;line-height:1.45}.facts{padding:12px 0;border-bottom:1px solid var(--line)}.fact{display:flex;justify-content:space-between;gap:10px;padding:7px 0;font-size:10px}.fact dt{color:#78909f}.fact dd{margin:0;text-align:right;color:#d7e5eb;max-width:160px}.fact dd.mono{font-size:10px}.verification{display:flex;align-items:center;justify-content:space-between;gap:10px;border:1px solid rgba(231,184,75,.3);background:rgba(231,184,75,.07);padding:10px;border-radius:7px;margin-top:12px}.verification-copy{display:flex;gap:8px;align-items:start}.verification-copy i{width:16px;height:16px;color:var(--amber);flex:none}.verification strong{display:block;font-size:10px;color:#f5dc91}.verification span{display:block;color:#bcae80;font-size:9px;line-height:1.4;margin-top:3px}.verify-btn{border:1px solid rgba(231,184,75,.48);background:transparent;color:#f5dc91;padding:7px 8px;border-radius:6px;font-size:9px;font-weight:800;cursor:pointer;white-space:nowrap}.checklist{padding-top:13px}.checklist-title{font-size:10px;text-transform:uppercase;letter-spacing:.12em;color:#78909f;font-weight:800}.step{display:flex;gap:9px;align-items:flex-start;padding:10px 0;border-bottom:1px solid rgba(41,70,92,.7)}.step:last-child{border-bottom:0}.step-mark{width:20px;height:20px;border:1px solid var(--line);display:grid;place-items:center;color:#78909f;border-radius:6px;flex:none}.step.done .step-mark{border-color:rgba(27,209,165,.45);background:rgba(27,209,165,.1);color:var(--mint)}.step.active .step-mark{border-color:rgba(90,167,255,.45);background:rgba(90,167,255,.1);color:var(--cyan)}.step strong{display:block;font-size:11px}.step span{display:block;color:#78909f;font-size:10px;line-height:1.4;margin-top:3px}.actions{display:grid;grid-template-columns:1fr 1fr;gap:8px;margin-top:13px}.action{min-height:44px;border-radius:7px;border:1px solid var(--line);background:transparent;color:#dcebf0;font-size:10px;font-weight:800;cursor:pointer;display:flex;align-items:center;justify-content:center;gap:7px}.action i{width:15px;height:15px}.action:hover{border-color:#54788d;background:#132c3f}.action.call{border-color:rgba(255,104,112,.58);background:var(--coral);color:#230e12;grid-column:span 2}.action.call:hover{background:#ff8990}.action.progress{border-color:rgba(27,209,165,.5);background:var(--mint);color:#061a17;grid-column:span 2}.action.progress:hover{background:#7ce8cc}.audit{margin-top:14px}.audit label{display:block;color:#78909f;font-size:10px;text-transform:uppercase;letter-spacing:.1em;font-weight:800;margin-bottom:7px}.audit textarea{width:100%;min-height:64px;resize:vertical;border:1px solid var(--line);border-radius:7px;background:#0b1927;color:var(--text);padding:9px;font:11px Inter,sans-serif;outline:none}.audit textarea:focus{border-color:rgba(90,167,255,.65)}.audit textarea::placeholder{color:#667e8d}.offline{margin-top:13px;border:1px solid rgba(231,184,75,.34);background:rgba(231,184,75,.07);border-radius:7px;padding:10px;color:#d1bd78;font-size:10px;line-height:1.45;display:flex;gap:8px}.offline i{width:15px;height:15px;flex:none;color:var(--amber)}.feedback{position:fixed;right:22px;bottom:20px;z-index:20;display:none;align-items:center;gap:8px;border:1px solid rgba(27,209,165,.42);background:#102f35;color:#a3f3df;border-radius:8px;padding:11px 13px;font-size:11px;box-shadow:0 10px 30px rgba(0,0,0,.22)}.feedback.show{display:flex}.feedback i{width:15px;height:15px}\n  @media (max-width:1050px){.workgrid{grid-template-columns:250px minmax(340px,1fr)}.dispatch{grid-column:1/-1}.dispatch-panel{display:grid;grid-template-columns:1fr 1fr;gap:14px}.dispatch-panel .risk-summary,.dispatch-panel .facts,.dispatch-panel .verification,.dispatch-panel .checklist,.dispatch-panel .actions,.dispatch-panel .audit,.dispatch-panel .offline{margin-top:0}.dispatch-panel .facts{border-bottom:0;padding:0}.dispatch-panel .checklist{padding-top:0}.dispatch-panel .audit{grid-column:span 2}.dispatch-panel .offline{grid-column:span 2}}\n  @media (max-width:720px){.topbar{padding:13px 15px;align-items:flex-start}.brand{min-width:0}.unit-meta{display:none}.operator{margin-left:auto;padding-left:0;border-left:0}.operator div:last-child{display:none}.critical-banner{margin:12px 15px 0;align-items:flex-start;padding:13px}.critical-right{display:block}.critical-right .mono{display:block;margin-bottom:7px}.page{padding:16px 15px 30px}.headline{display:block}.headline h2{font-size:23px}.sync-note{margin-top:13px;white-space:normal}.kpis{grid-template-columns:repeat(2,1fr)}.workgrid{display:block}.panel{margin-bottom:12px}.queue{max-height:none}.map{height:360px}.dispatch-panel{display:block}.dispatch-panel .risk-summary,.dispatch-panel .facts,.dispatch-panel .verification,.dispatch-panel .checklist,.dispatch-panel .actions,.dispatch-panel .audit,.dispatch-panel .offline{margin-top:12px}.dispatch-panel .facts{border-bottom:1px solid var(--line);padding:12px 0}.dispatch-panel .checklist{padding-top:12px}.dispatch-panel .audit{margin-top:14px}.dispatch-panel .offline{margin-top:13px}}\n</style>\n<div class=\"sy-wrap\" data-kid=\"1\" data-name=\"responder workspace layout container\">\n    <header class=\"topbar\" data-kid=\"1-1\" data-name=\"header section\">\n        <div class=\"brand\" data-kid=\"1-1-1\" data-name=\"brand identity container\">\n            <div class=\"brand-mark\" data-kid=\"1-1-1-1\" data-name=\"brand mark shield icon container\">\n                <i data-kid=\"1-1-1-1-1\" data-lucide=\"shield-check\" data-name=\"shield check icon\">\n                </i>\n            </div>\n            <div class=\"brand-copy\" data-kid=\"1-1-1-2\" data-name=\"brand text container\">\n                <div class=\"brand-name\" data-kid=\"1-1-1-2-1\" data-name=\"brand name with AI badge\">\n                    SafeYatra\n                    <span data-kid=\"1-1-1-2-1-1\" data-name=\"AI badge text\">\n                        AI\n                    </span>\n                </div>\n                <div class=\"brand-sub\" data-kid=\"1-1-1-2-2\" data-name=\"brand subtitle text\">\n                    Responder workspace\n                </div>\n            </div>\n        </div>\n        <div class=\"unit-meta\" data-kid=\"1-1-2\" data-name=\"unit metadata information\">\n            <div class=\"crumb\" data-kid=\"1-1-2-1\" data-name=\"breadcrumb navigation trail\">\n                Field operations /\n                <strong data-kid=\"1-1-2-1-1\" data-name=\"unit identifier text\">\n                    Unit Alpha-07\n                </strong>\n            </div>\n            <div class=\"live-pill\" data-kid=\"1-1-2-2\" data-name=\"unit online status pill\">\n                <span class=\"dot\" data-kid=\"1-1-2-2-1\" data-name=\"status online dot indicator\">\n                </span>\n                Unit online\n            </div>\n        </div>\n        <div class=\"operator\" data-kid=\"1-1-3\" data-name=\"operator profile container\">\n            <div class=\"avatar\" data-kid=\"1-1-3-1\" data-name=\"operator avatar initials\">\n                RP\n            </div>\n            <div data-kid=\"1-1-3-2\" data-name=\"operator detail text container\">\n                <strong data-kid=\"1-1-3-2-1\" data-name=\"operator name\">\n                    Ravi Patil\n                </strong>\n                <span class=\"mono\" data-kid=\"1-1-3-2-2\" data-name=\"last sync timestamp text\">\n                    last sync 08:42 UTC\n                </span>\n            </div>\n        </div>\n    </header>\n    <section class=\"critical-banner\" data-kid=\"1-2\" data-name=\"critical incident notification banner\">\n        <div class=\"critical-left\" data-kid=\"1-2-1\" data-name=\"banner alert content container\">\n            <div class=\"critical-icon\" data-kid=\"1-2-1-1\" data-name=\"siren icon container\">\n                <i data-kid=\"1-2-1-1-1\" data-lucide=\"siren\" data-name=\"siren icon\">\n                </i>\n            </div>\n            <div data-kid=\"1-2-1-2\" data-name=\"alert details text container\">\n                <div class=\"eyebrow\" data-kid=\"1-2-1-2-1\" data-name=\"alert eyebrow text\" style=\"color:#ff9aa0\">\n                    Critical dispatch · responder assigned\n                </div>\n                <h1 data-kid=\"1-2-1-2-2\" data-name=\"alert main headline\">\n                    Aarav Mehta needs field assistance at Gangapur Dam Service Road\n                </h1>\n                <p data-kid=\"1-2-1-2-3\" data-name=\"alert descriptive details text\">\n                    Digital ID pending verification · live location captured · route locked to the last known GPS point\n                </p>\n            </div>\n        </div>\n        <div class=\"critical-right\" data-kid=\"1-2-2\" data-name=\"banner status container\">\n            <div class=\"mono\" data-kid=\"1-2-2-1\" data-name=\"incident reference and timestamp text\">\n                INC-2026-001 · 08:40 UTC\n            </div>\n            <div class=\"alert-status\" data-kid=\"1-2-2-2\" data-name=\"criticality percentage status pill\">\n                94% critical\n            </div>\n        </div>\n    </section>\n    <main class=\"page\" data-kid=\"1-3\" data-name=\"main operational board\">\n        <div class=\"headline\" data-kid=\"1-3-1\" data-name=\"headline and sync status container\">\n            <div data-kid=\"1-3-1-1\" data-name=\"headline information\">\n                <div class=\"eyebrow\" data-kid=\"1-3-1-1-1\" data-name=\"board section eyebrow text\">\n                    Response board / active assignment\n                </div>\n                <h2 data-kid=\"1-3-1-1-2\" data-name=\"board headline text\">\n                    Move from alert to action.\n                </h2>\n                <p data-kid=\"1-3-1-1-3\" data-name=\"board description text\">\n                    Follow the shortest safe path, verify the tourist identity on arrival, and leave a clear audit trail for the control room.\n                </p>\n            </div>\n            <div class=\"sync-note\" data-kid=\"1-3-1-2\" data-name=\"offline synchronization note\">\n                <i data-kid=\"1-3-1-2-1\" data-lucide=\"cloud-off\" data-name=\"offline cloud icon\">\n                </i>\n                <span data-kid=\"1-3-1-2-2\" data-name=\"offline status message text\">\n                    <strong data-kid=\"1-3-1-2-2-1\" data-name=\"offline queue label\">\n                        Offline queue:\n                    </strong>\n                    1 pending update · will sync automatically\n                </span>\n            </div>\n        </div>\n        <section class=\"kpis\" data-kid=\"1-3-2\" data-name=\"key performance indicators grid\">\n            <div class=\"kpi critical\" data-kid=\"1-3-2-1\" data-name=\"KPI assigned incidents card\">\n                <div class=\"kpi-label\" data-kid=\"1-3-2-1-1\" data-name=\"KPI label\">\n                    Assigned now\n                </div>\n                <div class=\"kpi-value\" data-kid=\"1-3-2-1-2\" data-name=\"KPI value\">\n                    01\n                </div>\n                <div class=\"kpi-detail\" data-kid=\"1-3-2-1-3\" data-name=\"KPI description\">\n                    Critical incident · action required\n                </div>\n            </div>\n            <div class=\"kpi info\" data-kid=\"1-3-2-2\" data-name=\"KPI distance card\">\n                <div class=\"kpi-label\" data-kid=\"1-3-2-2-1\" data-name=\"KPI label\">\n                    Distance\n                </div>\n                <div class=\"kpi-value\" data-kid=\"1-3-2-2-2\" data-name=\"KPI value\">\n                    2.4 km\n                </div>\n                <div class=\"kpi-detail\" data-kid=\"1-3-2-2-3\" data-name=\"KPI description\">\n                    Mixed / wet road\n                </div>\n            </div>\n            <div class=\"kpi cautio