                       Digital ID pending\n                                </strong>\n                                <span data-kid=\"1-3-3-3-2-3-1-2-2\" data-name=\"verification description text\">\n                                    Verify hash on arrival before closing incident.\n                                </span>\n                            </div>\n                        </div>\n                        <button class=\"verify-btn\" data-kid=\"1-3-3-3-2-3-2\" data-message=\"Digital ID verification started.\" data-name=\"trigger verification button\">\n                            Verify\n                        </button>\n                    </div>\n                    <div class=\"checklist\" data-kid=\"1-3-3-3-2-4\" data-name=\"response steps checklist\">\n                        <div class=\"checklist-title\" data-kid=\"1-3-3-3-2-4-1\" data-name=\"checklist title\">\n                            Response checklist\n                        </div>\n                        <div class=\"step active\" data-kid=\"1-3-3-3-2-4-2\" data-name=\"checklist step active\">\n                            <div class=\"step-mark\" data-kid=\"1-3-3-3-2-4-2-1\" data-name=\"step status icon\">\n                                <i data-kid=\"1-3-3-3-2-4-2-1-1\" data-lucide=\"navigation\" data-name=\"step icon\">\n                                </i>\n                            </div>\n                            <div data-kid=\"1-3-3-3-2-4-2-2\" data-name=\"step instruction text\">\n                                <strong data-kid=\"1-3-3-3-2-4-2-2-1\" data-name=\"step title\">\n                                    Navigate\n                                </strong>\n                                <span data-kid=\"1-3-3-3-2-4-2-2-2\" data-name=\"step description\">\n                                    Follow 2.4 km route · ETA 06 minutes\n                                </span>\n                            </div>\n                        </div>\n                        <div class=\"step\" data-kid=\"1-3-3-3-2-4-3\" data-name=\"checklist step\">\n                            <div class=\"step-mark\" data-kid=\"1-3-3-3-2-4-3-1\" data-name=\"step status icon\">\n                                <i data-kid=\"1-3-3-3-2-4-3-1-1\" data-lucide=\"scan-line\" data-name=\"step icon\">\n                                </i>\n                            </div>\n                            <div data-kid=\"1-3-3-3-2-4-3-2\" data-name=\"step instruction text\">\n                                <strong data-kid=\"1-3-3-3-2-4-3-2-1\" data-name=\"step title\">\n                                    Verify ID\n                                </strong>\n                                <span data-kid=\"1-3-3-3-2-4-3-2-2\" data-name=\"step description\">\n                                    Confirm SY-2026-8F92A1 at the scene\n                                </span>\n                            </div>\n                        </div>\n                        <div class=\"step\" data-kid=\"1-3-3-3-2-4-4\" data-name=\"checklist step\">\n                            <div class=\"step-mark\" data-kid=\"1-3-3-3-2-4-4-1\" data-name=\"step status icon\">\n                                <i data-kid=\"1-3-3-3-2-4-4-1-1\" data-lucide=\"check-circle-2\" data-name=\"step icon\">\n                                </i>\n                            </div>\n                            <div data-kid=\"1-3-3-3-2-4-4-2\" data-name=\"step instruction text\">\n                                <strong data-kid=\"1-3-3-3-2-4-4-2-1\" data-name=\"step title\">\n                                    Resolve\n                                </strong>\n                                <span data-kid=\"1-3-3-3-2-4-4-2-2\" data-name=\"step description\">\n                                    Add a field note and close the response\n                                </span>\n                            </div>\n                        </div>\n                    </div>\n                    <div class=\"actions\" data-kid=\"1-3-3-3-2-5\" data-name=\"dispatch action buttons\">\n                        <button class=\"action call\" data-kid=\"1-3-3-3-2-5-1\" data-message=\"Calling Aarav Mehta via emergency contact channel.\" data-name=\"call action button\">\n                            <i data-kid=\"1-3-3-3-2-5-1-1\" data-lucide=\"phone\" data-name=\"call button icon\">\n                            </i>\n                            Call tourist\n                        </button>\n                        <button class=\"action progress\" data-kid=\"1-3-3-3-2-5-2\" data-message=\"Incident marked in progress. Control room notified.\" data-name=\"in-progress status button\">\n                            <i data-kid=\"1-3-3-3-2-5-2-1\" data-lucide=\"radio\" data-name=\"in-progress button icon\">\n                            </i>\n                            Mark in progress\n                        </button>\n                    </div>\n                    <div class=\"audit\" data-kid=\"1-3-3-3-2-6\" data-name=\"audit notes area\">\n                        <label data-kid=\"1-3-3-3-2-6-1\" data-name=\"audit notes label\" for=\"audit-note\">\n                            Audit note\n                        </label>\n                        <textarea data-kid=\"1-3-3-3-2-6-2\" data-name=\"audit notes text area\" id=\"audit-note\" placeholder=\"Add a field note for the control room…\"></textarea>\n                    </div>\n                    <div class=\"offline\" data-kid=\"1-3-3-3-2-7\" data-name=\"offline sync notification\">\n                        <i data-kid=\"1-3-3-3-2-7-1\" data-lucide=\"cloud-off\" data-name=\"offline sync status icon\">\n                        </i>\n                        <span data-kid=\"1-3-3-3-2-7-2\" data-name=\"offline status message text\">\n                            Offline update is stored locally with client ID\n                            <strong class=\"mono\" data-kid=\"1-3-3-3-2-7-2-1\" data-name=\"offline client ID text\">\n                                loc-7F3A\n                            </strong>\n                            . It will sync automatically when the network returns.\n                        </span>\n                    </div>\n                </div>\n            </aside>\n        </section>\n    </main>\n    <div class=\"feedback\" data-dynamic=\"true\" data-kid=\"1-4\" data-name=\"feedback toast notification\" data-reason=\"feedback visibility toggled and text content updated by script\" id=\"feedback\">\n        <i data-kid=\"1-4-1\" data-lucide=\"check-circle-2\" data-name=\"feedback check icon\">\n        </i>\n        <span data-dynamic=\"true\" data-kid=\"1-4-2\" data-name=\"feedback message text\" data-reason=\"text content updated dynamically by script\" id=\"feedback-text\">\n            Action recorded.\n        </span>\n    </div>\n</div>\n<script src=\"https://unpkg.com/lucide@latest\">\n</script>\n<script>\n    lucide.createIcons();\n  const feedback = document.getElementById('feedback');\n  const feedbackText = document.getElementById('feedback-text');\n  function showFeedback(message){ feedbackText.textContent = message; feedback.classList.add('show'); clearTimeout(window.__syFeedback); window.__syFeedback = setTimeout(()=>feedback.classList.remove('show'), 3200); }\n  document.querySelectorAll('[data-message]').forEach((el)=>el.addEventListener('click',()=>showFeedback(el.dataset.message)));\n  document.querySelector('.verify-btn').addEventListener('click',()=>showFeedback('Digital ID verification started · awaiting hash match.'));\n</script>\n",
      "comments": [],
      "created": "2026-07-26T05:40:04.886198+00:00",
      "modified": "2026-07-26T05:41:21.812836+00:00",
      "id": "var_146c69bfb2e9"
    },
    "var_30124b7edd07": {
      "type": "variant",
      "label": "Role Login · Operational Clarity",
      "parentId": null,
      "themeId": null,
      "rect": {
        "x": 11085,
        "y": 0,
        "w": 1280,
        "h": 800
      },
      "html": "<style>\n    @import url('https://fonts.googleapis.com/css2?family=Inter:wght@400;500;600;700;800&family=JetBrains+Mono:wght@500;600;700&display=swap');\n  .sy-login-page { min-height:100vh; background:#08121D; color:#EDF5F8; font-family:'Inter',ui-sans-serif,system-ui,sans-serif; }\n  .sy-login-page button,.sy-login-page input { font:inherit; }\n  .sy-login-page button { cursor:pointer; }\n  .sy-shell { min-height:100vh; display:grid; grid-template-columns:0.9fr 1.1fr; }\n  .sy-brand-pane { position:relative; display:flex; flex-direction:column; justify-content:space-between; padding:42px clamp(28px,5vw,76px); background:#0E1D2C; border-right:1px solid #29465C; overflow:hidden; }\n  .sy-brand-pane:after { content:''; position:absolute; right:-86px; bottom:-116px; width:280px; height:280px; border:1px solid rgba(90,167,255,.16); border-radius:50%; box-shadow:0 0 0 28px rgba(90,167,255,.04),0 0 0 56px rgba(90,167,255,.025); pointer-events:none; }\n  .sy-brand { display:flex; align-items:center; gap:12px; }\n  .sy-brand-mark { display:grid; place-items:center; width:42px; height:42px; border:1px solid rgba(27,209,165,.52); border-radius:11px; color:#1BD1A5; background:rgba(27,209,165,.09); }\n  .sy-brand-name { font-size:15px; font-weight:800; letter-spacing:-.03em; }\n  .sy-brand-name em { color:#1BD1A5; font-style:normal; }\n  .sy-brand-sub { margin-top:4px; color:#8BA0B0; font-size:10px; font-weight:700; letter-spacing:.16em; text-transform:uppercase; }\n  .sy-left-content { max-width:510px; position:relative; z-index:1; }\n  .sy-kicker { color:#1BD1A5; font-size:11px; font-weight:800; letter-spacing:.18em; text-transform:uppercase; }\n  .sy-hero { margin:22px 0 0; max-width:510px; font-size:clamp(34px,4vw,62px); line-height:.99; letter-spacing:-.065em; font-weight:800; }\n  .sy-hero span { color:#1BD1A5; }\n  .sy-copy { max-width:450px; margin-top:21px; color:#B5C5D0; font-size:15px; line-height:1.7; }\n  .sy-signal { margin-top:42px; max-width:470px; border:1px solid #29465C; border-radius:12px; background:#152A3D; }\n  .sy-signal-head { display:flex; justify-content:space-between; align-items:center; gap:16px; padding:16px 18px; border-bottom:1px solid #29465C; }\n  .sy-signal-title { display:flex; align-items:center; gap:9px; color:#EDF5F8; font-size:13px; font-weight:800; }\n  .sy-signal-dot { width:8px; height:8px; border-radius:999px; background:#1BD1A5; box-shadow:0 0 0 5px rgba(27,209,165,.11); }\n  .sy-mono { font-family:'JetBrains Mono',ui-monospace,monospace; }\n  .sy-signal-time { color:#8BA0B0; font-size:10px; }\n  .sy-signal-body { display:grid; grid-template-columns:1fr 1fr 1fr; gap:0; }\n  .sy-signal-cell { padding:16px 18px; border-right:1px solid #29465C; }\n  .sy-signal-cell:last-child { border-right:0; }\n  .sy-label { color:#8197A8; font-size:10px; font-weight:800; letter-spacing:.13em; text-transform:uppercase; }\n  .sy-value { margin-top:9px; color:#EDF5F8; font-size:15px; font-weight:800; }\n  .sy-value.mint { color:#1BD1A5; }\n  .sy-value.blue { color:#7DBAFF; }\n  .sy-footnote { color:#8197A8; font-size:11px; line-height:1.6; }\n  .sy-protected { display:flex; align-items:flex-start; gap:11px; max-width:440px; color:#9DB0BF; font-size:12px; line-height:1.55; }\n  .sy-protected i { flex:0 0 auto; color:#1BD1A5; margin-top:1px; }\n  .sy-form-pane { display:flex; align-items:center; justify-content:center; padding:42px clamp(28px,6vw,94px); background:#08121D; }\n  .sy-form-wrap { width:min(100%,560px); }\n  .sy-topline { display:flex; align-items:center; justify-content:space-between; gap:16px; margin-bottom:46px; }\n  .sy-back { color:#9DB0BF; font-size:12px; text-decoration:none; }\n  .sy-back:hover { color:#EDF5F8; }\n  .sy-network { display:inline-flex; align-items:center; gap:8px; border:1px solid rgba(27,209,165,.3); border-radius:999px; padding:8px 11px; color:#9AEEDC; background:rgba(27,209,165,.07); font-size:10px; font-weight:800; letter-spacing:.08em; text-transform:uppercase; }\n  .sy-network i { color:#1BD1A5; }\n  .sy-form-kicker { color:#5AA7FF; font-size:11px; font-weight:800; letter-spacing:.17em; text-transform:uppercase; }\n  .sy-form-title { margin-top:13px; color:#EDF5F8; font-size:clamp(28px,3vw,42px); line-height:1.05; letter-spacing:-.055em; font-weight:800; }\n  .sy-form-intro { margin-top:13px; color:#9DB0BF; font-size:14px; line-height:1.6; }\n  .sy-form { margin-top:32px; }\n  .sy-field { display:block; margin-top:19px; }\n  .sy-field:first-child { margin-top:0; }\n  .sy-field-label { display:block; margin-bottom:8px; color:#D5E0E7; font-size:12px; font-weight:700; }\n  .sy-input-wrap { position:relative; }\n  .sy-input-icon { position:absolute; left:14px; top:50%; transform:translateY(-50%); color:#718799; pointer-events:none; }\n  .sy-input { width:100%; height:48px; box-sizing:border-box; border:1px solid #29465C; border-radius:10px; padding:0 44px; outline:none; color:#EDF5F8; background:#0E1D2C; font-size:13px; }\n  .sy-input:focus { border-color:#5AA7FF; box-shadow:0 0 0 3px rgba(90,167,255,.12); }\n  .sy-password-toggle { position:absolute; right:8px; top:7px; display:grid; place-items:center; width:34px; height:34px; border:0; border-radius:7px; color:#8FA5B4; background:transparent; }\n  .sy-password-toggle:hover { color:#EDF5F8; background:#152A3D; }\n  .sy-form-row { display:flex; align-items:center; justify-content:space-between; gap:16px; margin-top:14px; }\n  .sy-check { display:flex; align-items:center; gap:8px; color:#9DB0BF; font-size:12px; }\n  .sy-check input { width:15px; height:15px; accent-color:#1BD1A5; }\n  .sy-link { color:#7DBAFF; font-size:12px; text-decoration:none; }\n  .sy-link:hover { color:#EDF5F8; }\n  .sy-primary { display:flex; align-items:center; justify-content:center; gap:9px; width:100%; min-height:48px; margin-top:25px; border:1px solid #1BD1A5; border-radius:10px; color:#06151A; background:#1BD1A5; font-size:13px; font-weight:800; }\n  .sy-primary:hover { background:#8AEED9; border-color:#8AEED9; }\n  .sy-secondary { display:flex; align-items:center; justify-content:center; gap:8px; width:100%; min-height:44px; margin-top:10px; border:1px solid #29465C; border-radius:10px; color:#B5C5D0; background:transparent; font-size:12px; font-weight:700; }\n  .sy-secondary:hover { border-color:#5AA7FF; color:#EDF5F8; background:rgba(90,167,255,.07); }\n  .sy-status { min-height:20px; margin-top:12px; color:#82DCC8; font-size:12px; }\n  .sy-demo { margin-top:34px; padding-top:25px; border-top:1px solid #29465C; }\n  .sy-demo-head { display:flex; align-items:flex-start; justify-content:space-between; gap:16px; }\n  .sy-demo-title { color:#EDF5F8; font-size:14px; font-weight:800; }\n  .sy-demo-copy { margin-top:5px; color:#8197A8; font-size:12px; line-height:1.5; }\n  .sy-demo-badge { flex:0 0 auto; border:1px solid rgba(90,167,255,.3); border-radius:999px; padding:7px 9px; color:#8CC5FF; background:rgba(90,167,255,.07); font-size:9px; font-weight:800; letter-spacing:.1em; text-transform:uppercase; }\n  .sy-role-grid { display:grid; grid-template-columns:1fr 1fr; gap:10px; margin-top:17px; }\n  .sy-role { display:flex; align-items:center; gap:11px; min-height:64px; border:1px solid #29465C; border-radius:10px; padding:11px 12px; text-align:left; color:#C8D5DD; background:#0E1D2C; }\n  .sy-role:hover,.sy-role.selected { border-color:#1BD1A5; background:rgba(27,209,165,.07); }\n  .sy-role-icon { display:grid; place-items:center; flex:0 0 auto; width:32px; height:32px; border-radius:8px; color:#5AA7FF; background:rgba(90,167,255,.12); }\n  .sy-role.selected .sy-role-icon { color:#1BD1A5; background:rgba(27,209,165,.13); }\n  .sy-role-name { color:#EDF5F8; font-size:12px; font-weight:800; }\n  .sy-role-meta { margin-top:4px; color:#8197A8; font-size:10px; }\n  .sy-demo-note { display:flex; align-items:flex-start; gap:9px; margin-top:15px; border:1px solid rgba(231,184,75,.25); border-radius:10px; padding:11px 12px; color:#C8B982; background:rgba(231,184,75,.06); font-size:11px; line-height:1.55; }\n  .sy-demo-note i { flex:0 0 auto; color:#E7B84B; margin-top:1px; }\n  @media (max-width:900px) { .sy-shell { grid-template-columns:1fr; } .sy-brand-pane { min-height:520px; border-right:0; border-bottom:1px solid #29465C; } .sy-form-pane { align-items:flex-start; padding-top:38px; padding-bottom:54px; } }\n  @media (max-width:560px) { .sy-brand-pane { min-height:auto; padding:26px 20px 30px; } .sy-left-content { margin-top:54px; } .sy-hero { font-size:39px; } .sy-copy { font-size:13px; } .sy-signal { margin-top:28px; } .sy-signal-cell { padding:13px 11px; } .sy-value { font-size:13px; } .sy-form-pane { padding:28px 20px 44px; } .sy-topline { margin-bottom:35px; } .sy-role-grid { grid-template-columns:1fr; } .sy-form-title { font-size:32px; } }\n</style>\n<div class=\"sy-login-page\" data-kid=\"1\" data-name=\"login page layout\">\n    <div class=\"sy-shell\" data-kid=\"1-1\" data-name=\"login page shell\">\n        <section aria-label=\"SafeYatra product overview\" class=\"sy-brand-pane\" data-kid=\"1-1-1\" data-name=\"product overview pane\">\n            <div class=\"sy-brand\" data-kid=\"1-1-1-1\" data-name=\"brand identity container\">\n                <span class=\"sy-brand-mark\" data-kid=\"1-1-1-1-1\" data-name=\"brand mark icon container\">\n                    <i data-kid=\"1-1-1-1-1-1\" data-lucide=\"shield-check\" data-name=\"shield check icon\" height=\"21\" width=\"21\">\n                    </i>\n                </span>\n                <div data-kid=\"1-1-1-1-2\" data-name=\"brand name group\">\n                    <div class=\"sy-brand-name\" data-kid=\"1-1-1-1-2-1\" data-name=\"brand name\">\n                        SafeYatra\n                        <em data-kid=\"1-1-1-1-2-1-1\" data-name=\"brand name accent text\">\n                            AI\n                        </em>\n                    </div>\n                    <div class=\"sy-brand-sub\" data-kid=\"1-1-1-1-2-2\" data-name=\"brand subtitle\">\n                        Safety network\n                    </div>\n                </div>\n            </div>\n            <div class=\"sy-left-content\" data-kid=\"1-1-1-2\" data-name=\"hero section content\">\n                <div class=\"sy-kicker\" data-kid=\"1-1-1-2-1\" data-name=\"hero kicker text\">\n                    One resilient safety layer\n                </div>\n                <h1 class=\"sy-hero\" data-kid=\"1-1-1-2-2\" data-name=\"hero headline\">\n                    Protect the journey.\n                    <br data-kid=\"1-1-1-2-2-1\" data-name=\"headline line break\"/>\n                    <span data-kid=\"1-1-1-2-2-2\" data-name=\"headline accent text\">\n                        Coordinate the response.\n                    </span>\n                </h1>\n                <p class=\"sy-copy\" data-kid=\"1-1-1-2-3\" data-name=\"hero description text\">\n                    A shared safety workspace for tourists, control rooms, field responders and system teams. Every signal stays clear when the journey gets complicated.\n                </p>\n                <div aria-label=\"Network status preview\" class=\"sy-signal\" data-kid=\"1-1-1-2-4\" data-name=\"network status preview card\">\n                    <div class=\"sy-signal-head\" data-kid=\"1-1-1-2-4-1\" data-name=\"status card header\">\n                        <div class=\"sy-signal-title\" data-kid=\"1-1-1-2-4-1-1\" data-name=\"network status title\">\n                            <span class=\"sy-signal-dot\" data-kid=\"1-1-1-2-4-1-1-1\" data-name=\"status online dot\">\n                            </span>\n                            Nashik safety network\n                        </div>\n                        <span class=\"sy-signal-time sy-mono\" data-kid=\"1-1-1-2-4-1-2\" data-name=\"network sync time\">\n                            08:42:18 UTC\n                        </span>\n                    </div>\n                    <div class=\"sy-signal-body\" data-kid=\"1-1-1-2-4-2\" data-name=\"status card metrics\">\n                        <div class=\"sy-signal-cell\" data-kid=\"1-1-1-2-4-2-1\" data-name=\"tourist count cell\">\n                            <div class=\"sy-label\" data-kid=\"1-1-1-2-4-2-1-1\" data-name=\"tourist count label\">\n                                Tourists covered\n                            </div>\n                            <div class=\"sy-value sy-mono\" data-kid=\"1-1-1-2-4-2-1-2\" data-name=\"tourist count value\">\n                                1,250\n                            </div>\n                        </div>\n                        <div class=\"sy-signal-cell\" data-kid=\"1-1-1-2-4-2-2\" data-name=\"risk refresh cell\">\n                            <div class=\"sy-label\" data-kid=\"1-1-1-2-4-2-2-1\" data-name=\"risk refresh label\">\n                                Risk refresh\n                            </div>\n                            <div class=\"sy-value mint sy-mono\" data-kid=\"1-1-1-2-4-2-2-2\" data-name=\"risk refresh value\">\n                                18 ms\n                            </div>\n                        </div>\n                        <div class=\"sy-signal-cell\" data-kid=\"1-1-1-2-4-2-3\" data-name=\"sync health cell\">\n                            <div class=\"sy-label\" data-kid=\"1-1-1-2-4-2-3-1\" data-name=\"sync health label\">\n                                Sync health\n                            </div>\n                            <div class=\"sy-value blue sy-mono\" data-kid=\"1-1-1-2-4-2-3-2\" data-name=\"sync health value\">\n                                99.2%\n                            </div>\n                        </div>\n                    </div>\n                </div>\n            </div>\n            <div class=\"sy-protected\" data-kid=\"1-1-1-3\" data-name=\"security note section\">\n                <i data-kid=\"1-1-1-3-1\" data-lucide=\"lock-keyhole\" data-name=\"lock icon\" height=\"16\" width=\"16\">\n                </i>\n                <span data-kid=\"1-1-1-3-2\" data-name=\"security note text\">\n                    Identity, location and incident context are shared only with the role that needs to act. Designed for high-pressure handoffs, including low-connectivity zones.\n                </span>\n            </div>\n        </section>\n        <main class=\"sy-form-pane\" data-kid=\"1-1-2\" data-name=\"sign-in form pane\">\n            <div class=\"sy-form-wrap\" data-kid=\"1-1-2-1\" data-name=\"form container\">\n                <div class=\"sy-topline\" data-kid=\"1-1-2-1-1\" data-name=\"top navigation bar\">\n                    <a class=\"sy-back\" data-kid=\"1-1-2-1-1-1\" data-name=\"back to overview link\" href=\"#\">\n                        ← Back to SafeYatra overview\n                    </a>\n                    <div class=\"sy-network\" data-kid=\"1-1-2-1-1-2\" data-name=\"system status badge\">\n                        <i data-kid=\"1-1-2-1-1-2-1\" data-lucide=\"wifi\" data-name=\"wifi icon\" height=\"13\" width=\"13\">\n                        </i>\n                        System operational\n                    </div>\n                </div>\n                <div class=\"sy-form-kicker\" data-kid=\"1-1-2-1-2\" data-name=\"form kicker text\">\n                    Secure workspace access\n                </div>\n                <h2 class=\"sy-form-title\" data-kid=\"1-1-2-1-3\" data-name=\"sign-in headline\">\n                    Sign in to your safety workspace.\n                </h2>\n                <p class=\"sy-form-intro\" data-kid=\"1-1-2-1-4\" data-name=\"sign-in description text\">\n                    Use your account or choose a demo role below to walk through the complete response chain.\n                </p>\n                <form class=\"sy-form\" data-kid=\"1-1-2-1-5\" data-name=\"login form\" id=\"login-form\">\n                    <label class=\"sy-field\" data-kid=\"1-1-2-1-5-1\" data-name=\"email field group\">\n                        <span class=\"sy-field-label\" data-kid=\"1-1-2-1-5-1-1\" data-name=\"email label\">\n                            Work email\n                        </span>\n                        <span class=\"sy-input-wrap\" data-kid=\"1-1-2-1-5-1-2\" data-name=\"email input wrapper\">\n                            <i class=\"sy-input-icon\" data-kid=\"1-1-2-1-5-1-2-1\" data-lucide=\"mail\" data-name=\"mail icon\" height=\"17\" width=\"17\">\n                            </i>\n                            <input aria-label=\"Work email\" autocomplete=\"email\" class=\"sy-input\" data-dynamic=\"true\" data-kid=\"1-1-2-1-5-1-2-2\" data-name=\"email input field\" data-reason=\"value replaced/initialized by demo role buttons\" id=\"email\" type=\"email\" value=\"auth@safeyatra.com\"/>\n                        </span>\n                    </label>\n                    <label class=\"sy-field\" data-kid=\"1-1-2-1-5-2\" data-name=\"password field group\">\n                        <span class=\"sy-field-label\" data-kid=\"1-1-2-1-5-2-1\" data-name=\"password label\">\n                            Password\n                        </span>\n                        <span class=\"sy-input-wrap\" data-kid=\"1-1-2-1-5-2-2\" data-name=\"password input wrapper\">\n                            <i class=\"sy-input-icon\" data-kid=\"1-1-2-1-5-2-2-1\" data-lucide=\"key-round\" data-name=\"key icon\" height=\"17\" width=\"17\">\n                            </i>\n                            <input aria-label=\"Password\" autocomplete=\"current-password\" class=\"sy-input\" data-dynamic=\"true\" data-kid=\"1-1-2-1-5-2-2-2\" data-name=\"password input field\" data-reason=\"value replaced/initialized by demo role buttons and type attribute toggled by script\" id=\"password\" type=\"password\" value=\"auth123\"/>\n                            <button aria-label=\"Show password\" class=\"sy-password-toggle\" data-dynamic=\"true\" data-kid=\"1-1-2-1-5-2-2-3\" data-name=\"password visibility toggle\" data-reason=\"innerHTML replaced by icon update script\" id=\"toggle-password\" type=\"button\">\n                                <i data-dynamic=\"true\" data-kid=\"1-1-2-1-5-2-2-3-1\" data-lucide=\"eye\" data-name=\"password eye icon\" data-reason=\"replaced by script on click\" height=\"16\" width=\"16\">\n                                </i>\n                            </button>\n                        </span>\n                    </label>\n                    <div class=\"sy-form-row\" data-kid=\"1-1-2-1-5-3\" data-name=\"form action row\">\n                        <label class=\"sy-check\" data-kid=\"1-1-2-1-5-3-1\" data-name=\"keep signed in checkbox\">\n                            <input checked=\"\" data-kid=\"1-1-2-1-5-3-1-1\" data-name=\"checkbox input\" type=\"checkbox\"/>\n                            Keep me signed in on this device\n                        </label>\n                        <a class=\"sy-link\" data-kid=\"1-1-2-1-5-3-2\" data-name=\"forgot password link\" href=\"#\">\n                            Forgot password?\n                        </a>\n                    </div>\n                    <button class=\"sy-primary\" data-kid=\"1-1-2-1-5-4\" data-name=\"sign in button\" type=\"submit\">\n                        <i data-kid=\"1-1-2-1-5-4-1\" data-lucide=\"log-in\" data-name=\"log-in icon\" height=\"16\" width=\"16\">\n                        </i>\n                        Sign in to workspace\n                    </button>\n                    <button class=\"sy-secondary\" data-kid=\"1-1-2-1-5-5\" data-name=\"continue offline button\" id=\"offline-btn\" type=\"button\">\n                        <i data-kid=\"1-1-2-1-5-5-1\" data-lucide=\"cloud-off\" data-name=\"cloud off icon\" height=\"16\" width=\"16\">\n                        </i>\n                        Continue offline\n                    </button>\n                    <div aria-live=\"polite\" class=\"sy-status\" data-dynamic=\"true\" data-kid=\"1-1-2-1-5-6\" data-name=\"form status message\" data-reason=\"text and color updated by script for feedback\" id=\"form-status\">\n                    </div>\n                </form>\n                <section aria-label=\"Demo access\" class=\"sy-demo\" data-kid=\"1-1-2-1-6\" data-name=\"demo access section\">\n                    <div class=\"sy-demo-head\" data-kid=\"1-1-2-1-6-1\" data-name=\"demo access header\">\n                        <div data-kid=\"1-1-2-1-6-1-1\" data-name=\"demo title group\">\n                            <div class=\"sy-demo-title\" data-kid=\"1-1-2-1-6-1-1-1\" data-name=\"demo access title\">\n                                Demo access\n                            </div>\n                            <div class=\"sy-demo-copy\" data-kid=\"1-1-2-1-6-1-1-2\" data-name=\"demo access description\">\n                                Choose a role to preload realistic credentials.\n                            </div>\n                        </div>\n                        <span class=\"sy-demo-badge\" data-kid=\"1-1-2-1-6-1-2\" data-name=\"demo badge\">\n                            Hackathon ready\n                        </span>\n                    </div>\n                    <div class=\"sy-role-grid\" data-kid=\"1-1-2-1-6-2\" data-name=\"role selection grid\">\n                        <button class=\"sy-role\" data-email=\"tourist@safeyatra.com\" data-kid=\"1-1-2-1-6-2-1\" data-name=\"tourist role button\" data-password=\"tour123\" data-role=\"tourist\" type=\"button\">\n                            <span class=\"sy-role-icon\" data-kid=\"1-1-2-1-6-2-1-1\" data-name=\"tourist icon container\">\n                                <i data-kid=\"1-1-2-1-6-2-1-1-1\" data-lucide=\"map-pin\" data-name=\"map pin icon\" height=\"16\" width=\"16\">\n                                </i>\n                            </span>\n                            <span data-kid=\"1-1-2-1-6-2-1-2\" data-name=\"tourist label group\">\n                                <span class=\"sy-role-name\" data-kid=\"1-1-2-1-6-2-1-2-1\" data-name=\"tourist role name\">\n                                    Tourist\n                                </span>\n                                <span class=\"sy-role-meta\" data-kid=\"1-1-2-1-6-2-1-2-2\" data-name=\"tourist role meta\">\n                                    Aarav Mehta · SY-1001\n                                </span>\n                            </span>\n                        </button>\n                        <button class=\"sy-role selected\" data-email=\"auth@safeyatra.com\" data-kid=\"1-1-2-1-6-2-2\" data-name=\"authority role button\" data-password=\"auth123\" data-role=\"authority\" type=\"button\">\n                            <span class=\"sy-role-icon\" data-kid=\"1-1-2-1-6-2-2-1\" data-name=\"authority icon container\">\n                                <i data-kid=\"1-1-2-1-6-2-2-1-1\" data-lucide=\"radio-tower\" data-name=\"radio tower icon\" height=\"16\" width=\"16\">\n                                </i>\n                            </span>\n                            <span data-kid=\"1-1-2-1-6-2-2-2\" data-name=\"authority label group\">\n                                <span class=\"sy-role-name\" data-kid=\"1-1-2-1-6-2-2-2-1\" data-name=\"authority role name\">\n                                    Authority\n                                </span>\n                                <span class=\"sy-role-meta\" data-kid=\"1-1-2-1-6-2-2-2-2\" data-name=\"authority role meta\">\n                                    Nashik Control Room\n                                </span>\n                            </span>\n                        </button>\n                        <button class=\"sy-role\" data-email=\"resp@safeyatra.com\" data-kid=\"1-1-2-1-6-2-3\" data-name=\"responder role button\" data-password=\"resp123\" data-role=\"responder\" type=\"button\">\n                            <span class=\"sy-role-icon\" data-kid=\"1-1-2-1-6-2-3-1\" data-name=\"responder icon container\">\n                                <i data-kid=\"1-1-2-1-6-2-3-1-1\" data-lucide=\"ambulance\" data-name=\"ambulance icon\" height=\"16\" width=\"16\">\n                                </i>\n                            </span>\n                            <span data-kid=\"1-1-2-1-6-2-3-2\" data-name=\"responder label group\">\n                                <span class=\"sy-role-name\" data-kid=\"1-1-2-1-6-2-3-2-1\" data-name=\"responder role name\">\n                                    Responder\n                                </span>\n                                <span class=\"sy-role-meta\" data-kid=\"1-1-2-1-6-2-3-2-2\" data-name=\"responder role meta\">\n                                    Ravi Patil · Unit Alpha-07\n                                </span>\n                            </span>\n                        </button>\n                        <button class=\"sy-role\" data-email=\"admin@safeyatra.com\" data-kid=\"1-1-2-1-6-2-4\" data-name=\"admin role button\" data-password=\"admin123\" data-role=\"admin\" type=\"button\">\n                            <span class=\"sy-role-icon\" data-kid=\"1-1-2-1-6-2-4-1\" data-name=\"admin icon container\">\n                                <i data-kid=\"1-1-2-1-6-2-4-1-1\" data-lucide=\"settings-2\" data-name=\"settings icon\" height=\"16\" width=\"16\">\n                                </i>\n                            </span>\n                            <span data-kid=\"1-1-2-1-6-2-4-2\" data-name=\"admin label group\">\n                                <span class=\"sy-role-name\" data-kid=\"1-1-2-1-6-2-4-2-1\" data-name=\"admin role name\">\n                                    Admin\n                                </span>\n                                <span class=\"sy-role-meta\" data-kid=\"1-1-2-1-6-2-4-2-2\" data-name=\"admin role meta\">\n                                    System Administrator\n                                </span>\n                            </span>\n                        </button>\n                    </div>\n                    <div class=\"sy-demo-note\" data-kid=\"1-1-2-1-6-3\" data-name=\"demo note section\">\n                        <i data-kid=\"1-1-2-1-6-3-1\" data-lucide=\"hard-drive\" data-name=\"hard drive icon\" height=\"15\" width=\"15\">\n                        </i>\n                        <span data-kid=\"1-1-2-1-6-3-2\" data-name=\"demo note text\">\n                            Offline-first demo: GPS tracking, geo-fence risk checks, SOS creation and the local sync queue remain available without internet.\n                        </span>\n                    </div>\n                </section>\n            </div>\n        </main>\n    </div>\n</div>\n<script src=\"https://unpkg.com/lucide@latest\">\n</script>\n<script>\n    lucide.createIcons();\n  const email = document.getElementById('email');\n  const password = document.getElementById('password');\n  const status = document.getElementById('form-status');\n  const setStatus = (text, color = '#82DCC8') => { status.textContent = text; status.style.color = color; };\n  document.querySelectorAll('.sy-role').forEach((button) => button.addEventListener('click', () => {\n    document.querySelectorAll('.sy-role').forEach((role) => role.classList.remove('selected'));\n    button.classList.add('selected'); email.value = button.dataset.email; password.value = button.dataset.password;\n    setStatus(button.dataset.role.charAt(0).toUpperCase() + button.dataset.role.slice(1) + ' demo credentials loaded.');\n  }));\n  document.getElementById('toggle-password').addEventListener('click', () => { const showing = password.type === 'text'; password.type = showing ? 'password' : 'text'; document.getElementById('toggle-password').setAttribute('aria-label', showing ? 'Show password' : 'Hide password'); document.getElementById('toggle-password').innerHTML = '<i data-lucide=\"' + (showing ? 'eye' : 'eye-off') + '\" width=\"16\" height=\"16\"></i>'; lucide.createIcons(); });\n  document.getElementById('login-form').addEventListener('submit', (event) => { event.preventDefault(); setStatus('Credentials accepted · opening the selected workspace.'); });\n  document.getElementById('offline-btn').addEventListener('click', () => setStatus('Offline mode enabled · local safety signals are ready.', '#E7B84B'));\n</script>\n",
      "comments": [],
      "created": "2026-07-26T05:40:03.450496+00:00",
      "modified": "2026-07-26T05:41:10.973520+00:00",
      "id": "var_30124b7edd07"
    },
    "var_6dc95c9d08f9": {
      "type": "variant",
      "label": "Admin Control Plane · Operational Clarity",
      "parentId": null,
      "themeId": null,
      "rect": {
        "x": 12465,
        "y": 0,
        "w": 1280,
        "h": 800
      },
      "html": "<style>\n    @import url('https://fonts.googleapis.com/css2?family=Inter:wght@400;500;600;700;800&family=JetBrains+Mono:wght@500;600;700&display=swap');\n  .admin-page { min-height: 100vh; background: #08121D; color: #EDF5F8; font-family: Inter, ui-sans-serif, system-ui, sans-serif; }\n  .admin-shell { max-width: 1440px; margin: 0 auto; padding: 0 28px 44px; }\n  .admin-topbar { min-height: 72px; display:flex; align-items:center; justify-content:space-between; gap:20px; border-bottom:1px solid #29465C; }\n  .brand { display:flex; align-items:center; gap:12px; }\n  .brand-mark { width:38px; height:38px; display:grid; place-items:center; border:1px solid rgba(27,209,165,.55); border-radius:10px; color:#1BD1A5; background:#0E1D2C; }\n  .brand-name { font-size:14px; font-weight:800; letter-spacing:-.02em; color:#F6FBFC; }\n  .brand-name span { color:#1BD1A5; }\n  .brand-sub { margin-top:3px; font-size:10px; letter-spacing:.16em; text-transform:uppercase; color:#8DA3B2; }\n  .top-actions { display:flex; align-items:center; gap:10px; }\n  .env-pill,.sync-pill { display:flex; align-items:center; gap:8px; min-height:34px; padding:0 11px; border:1px solid #29465C; border-radius:999px; background:#0E1D2C; color:#B9CAD4; font-size:11px; font-weight:700; }\n  .env-dot { width:7px; height:7px; border-radius:50%; background:#1BD1A5; box-shadow:0 0 0 4px rgba(27,209,165,.12); }\n  .avatar { width:34px; height:34px; display:grid; place-items:center; border:1px solid #29465C; border-radius:50%; background:#152A3D; color:#D9E9EE; font-family:'JetBrains Mono',monospace; font-size:11px; font-weight:700; }\n  .eyebrow { color:#8DA3B2; font-size:10px; text-transform:uppercase; letter-spacing:.16em; font-weight:800; }\n  .mono { font-family:'JetBrains Mono',monospace; }\n  .hero { display:flex; align-items:flex-end; justify-content:space-between; gap:30px; padding:34px 0 24px; }\n  .hero h1 { margin:7px 0 0; color:#F6FBFC; font-size:32px; line-height:1.08; letter-spacing:-.04em; font-weight:800; }\n  .hero p { max-width:640px; margin:10px 0 0; color:#9FB2BE; font-size:13px; line-height:1.65; }\n  .hero-meta { display:flex; gap:18px; align-items:center; color:#8DA3B2; font-size:11px; white-space:nowrap; }\n  .hero-meta strong { color:#E7F3F5; font-family:'JetBrains Mono',monospace; font-size:12px; }\n  .kpis { display:grid; grid-template-columns:repeat(5,minmax(0,1fr)); gap:10px; }\n  .kpi { min-height:116px; padding:16px; border:1px solid #29465C; border-radius:10px; background:#0E1D2C; }\n  .kpi.critical { border-color:rgba(255,104,112,.45); background:#1B1720; }\n  .kpi.warning { border-color:rgba(231,184,75,.40); background:#191A1A; }\n  .kpi-label { display:flex; align-items:center; justify-content:space-between; color:#9FB2BE; font-size:11px; font-weight:700; }\n  .kpi-icon { color:#5AA7FF; }\n  .kpi.critical .kpi-icon { color:#FF6870; }\n  .kpi.warning .kpi-icon { color:#E7B84B; }\n  .kpi-value { margin-top:17px; color:#F6FBFC; font-family:'JetBrains Mono',monospace; font-size:25px; font-weight:700; letter-spacing:-.04em; }\n  .kpi-note { margin-top:6px; color:#8299A8; font-size:11px; }\n  .main-grid { display:grid; grid-template-columns:1.05fr 1.45fr .9fr; gap:12px; margin-top:12px; align-items:start; }\n  .panel { border:1px solid #29465C; border-radius:10px; background:#0E1D2C; overflow:hidden; }\n  .panel-head { display:flex; align-items:flex-start; justify-content:space-between; gap:18px; padding:17px 18px 14px; border-bottom:1px solid #29465C; }\n  .panel-head h2 { margin:4px 0 0; color:#F1F8FA; font-size:14px; font-weight:800; letter-spacing:-.02em; }\n  .panel-head p { margin:5px 0 0; color:#8299A8; font-size:11px; line-height:1.45; }\n  .icon-button { width:30px; height:30px; display:grid; place-items:center; border:1px solid #29465C; border-radius:8px; background:#152A3D; color:#AFC2CB; cursor:pointer; }\n  .icon-button:hover { border-color:#5AA7FF; color:#F6FBFC; }\n  .incident-list { padding:8px; }\n  .incident { display:block; width:100%; padding:13px 11px; border:1px solid transparent; border-radius:8px; background:transparent; text-align:left; color:#EAF4F6; cursor:pointer; }\n  .incident:hover { background:#152A3D; }\n  .incident.selected { border-color:rgba(255,104,112,.42); background:#1B1720; }\n  .incident-row { display:flex; align-items:center; justify-content:space-between; gap:10px; }\n  .incident-id { color:#DCECEF; font-family:'JetBrains Mono',monospace; font-size:11px; font-weight:700; }\n  .risk { display:inline-flex; align-items:center; gap:5px; padding:4px 7px; border:1px solid rgba(255,104,112,.44); border-radius:999px; color:#FF9BA0; font-size:9px; font-weight:800; letter-spacing:.08em; }\n  .risk-dot { width:6px; height:6px; border-radius:50%; background:#FF6870; }\n  .incident-name { margin:10px 0 0; color:#F4FAFB; font-size:12px; font-weight:800; }\n  .incident-detail { margin:4px 0 0; color:#8DA3B2; font-size:11px; line-height:1.45; }\n  .incident-footer { display:flex; gap:10px; margin-top:10px; color:#6F8796; font-size:10px; }\n  .incident-footer span { display:flex; align-items:center; gap:5px; }\n  .map-panel { min-height:490px; }\n  .map { position:relative; min-height:382px; margin:14px; overflow:hidden; border:1px solid #29465C; border-radius:8px; background:#0A1B29; }\n  .map:before,.map:after { content:''; position:absolute; inset:0; opacity:.46; pointer-events:none; }\n  .map:before { background:linear-gradient(24deg,transparent 44%,#183649 45%,#183649 46%,transparent 47%),linear-gradient(157deg,transparent 48%,#183649 49%,#183649 50%,transparent 51%); }\n  .map:after { background:linear-gradient(90deg,transparent 0 24%,rgba(43,78,95,.3) 24.2% 24.5%,transparent 24.7% 54%,rgba(43,78,95,.24) 54.2% 54.5%,transparent 54.7%); }\n  .map-label { position:absolute; z-index:2; color:#718A99; font-size:9px; text-transform:uppercase; letter-spacing:.12em; font-weight:800; }\n  .zone { position:absolute; z-index:1; display:grid; place-items:center; border-radius:50%; border:1px solid; font-size:9px; text-transform:uppercase; letter-spacing:.10em; font-weight:800; }\n  .zone.safe { width:150px; height:150px; left:11%; top:13%; border-color:rgba(27,209,165,.46); background:rgba(27,209,165,.10); color:#8BEBD4; }\n  .zone.caution { width:190px; height:190px; left:41%; top:29%; border-color:rgba(231,184,75,.5); background:rgba(231,184,75,.09); color:#F2D987; }\n  .zone.danger { width:150px; height:150px; right:8%; top:8%; border-color:rgba(255,104,112,.62); background:rgba(255,104,112,.12); color:#FF9BA0; }\n  .marker { position:absolute; z-index:4; width:28px; height:28px; display:grid; place-items:center; border:2px solid #F6FBFC; border-radius:50%; color:#08121D; box-shadow:0 0 0 6px rgba(255,255,255,.08); }\n  .marker.safe { left:26%; top:44%; background:#1BD1A5; }\n  .marker.high { left:57%; top:62%; background:#E7B84B; }\n  .marker.critical { right:24%; top:25%; background:#FF6870; box-shadow:0 0 0 6px rgba(255,104,112,.18); }\n  .marker-label { position:absolute; top:31px; left:50%; transform:translateX(-50%); padding:4px 6px; border:1px solid #29465C; border-radius:5px; background:#08121D; color:#EDF5F8; font-family:'JetBrains Mono',monospace; font-size:9px; white-space:nowrap; }\n  .map-legend { display:flex; flex-wrap:wrap; gap:12px; padding:0 14px 14px; color:#9FB2BE; font-size:10px; }\n  .legend-item { display:flex; align-items:center; gap:6px; }\n  .legend-dot { width:8px; height:8px; border-radius:50%; }\n  .legend-dot.safe { background:#1BD1A5; }.legend-dot.caution { background:#E7B84B; }.legend-dot.danger { background:#FF6870; }.legend-dot.info { background:#5AA7FF; }\n  .fallback { margin:0 14px 14px; display:flex; align-items:flex-start; gap:9px; padding:10px; border:1px dashed #29465C; border-radius:8px; color:#8DA3B2; font-size:10px; line-height:1.45; }\n  .fallback i { color:#E7B84B; }\n  .inspector-body { padding:15px 17px 17px; }\n  .entity { display:flex; align-items:center; gap:10px; padding-bottom:15px; border-bottom:1px solid #29465C; }\n  .entity-avatar { width:40px; height:40px; display:grid; place-items:center; border:1px solid rgba(255,104,112,.45); border-radius:9px; background:rgba(255,104,112,.10); color:#FF9BA0; }\n  .entity-name { color:#F6FBFC; font-size:13px; font-weight:800; }.entity-id { margin-top:4px; color:#8DA3B2; font-family:'JetBrains Mono',monospace; font-size:10px; }\n  .facts { display:grid; gap:0; margin-top:10px; }\n  .fact { display:flex; justify-content:space-between; gap:12px; padding:10px 0; border-bottom:1px solid rgba(41,70,92,.62); }\n  .fact:last-child { border-bottom:0; }.fact dt { color:#8299A8; font-size:11px; }.fact dd { margin:0; color:#E8F3F5; font-size:11px; text-align:right; }.fact dd.mono { font-size:10px; }\n  .timeline { margin-top:15px; padding-top:14px; border-top:1px solid #29465C; }.timeline-title { color:#8DA3B2; font-size:10px; text-transform:uppercase; letter-spacing:.14em; font-weight:800; }\n  .step { position:relative; display:grid; grid-template-columns:18px 1fr; gap:9px; padding:11px 0 0; }.step:not(:last-child):before { content:''; position:absolute; left:8px; top:27px; width:1px; height:25px; background:#29465C; }.step-dot { width:17px; height:17px; display:grid; place-items:center; border-radius:50%; border:1px solid #29465C; background:#152A3D; color:#8DA3B2; }.step.done .step-dot { border-color:rgba(27,209,165,.55); background:rgba(27,209,165,.13); color:#1BD1A5; }.step.active .step-dot { border-color:rgba(255,104,112,.55); background:rgba(255,104,112,.12); color:#FF6870; }.step-label { color:#DCECEF; font-size:11px; font-weight:700; }.step-time { margin-top:3px; color:#6F8796; font-family:'JetBrains Mono',monospace; font-size:9px; }\n  .actions { display:grid; gap:8px; margin-top:16px; }.button { min-height:42px; display:inline-flex; align-items:center; justify-content:center; gap:8px; border:1px solid #29465C; border-radius:8px; background:#152A3D; color:#DDECEF; font-size:11px; font-weight:800; cursor:pointer; }.button:hover { border-color:#5AA7FF; color:#fff; }.button.primary { border-color:rgba(27,209,165,.55); background:#1BD1A5; color:#08121D; }.button.primary:hover { background:#66E3C5; }.button.critical { border-color:rgba(255,104,112,.55); background:rgba(255,104,112,.12); color:#FFB3B7; }\n  .lower-grid { display:grid; grid-template-columns:1fr 1fr; gap:12px; margin-top:12px; }.lower-panel { min-height:260px; }\n  .lower-body { padding:16px 18px; }.health-list { display:grid; gap:13px; }.health-row { display:grid; grid-template-columns:1fr auto; gap:10px; align-items:center; }.health-name { color:#DCECEF; font-size:11px; font-weight:700; }.health-value { color:#8BEBD4; font-family:'JetBrains Mono',monospace; font-size:10px; }.health-value.warn { color:#F2D987; }.health-bar { height:5px; margin-top:7px; overflow:hidden; border-radius:999px; background:#152A3D; }.health-fill { height:100%; border-radius:999px; background:#1BD1A5; }.health-fill.warn { background:#E7B84B; }\n  .sync-box { margin-top:18px; display:flex; align-items:center; justify-content:space-between; gap:12px; padding:11px; border:1px solid rgba(231,184,75,.35); border-radius:8px; background:rgba(231,184,75,.07); }.sync-copy strong { display:block; color:#F2D987; font-size:11px; }.sync-copy span { display:block; margin-top:4px; color:#A8A9A0; font-size:10px; }.sync-button { min-height:34px; padding:0 10px; border:1px solid rgba(231,184,75,.45); border-radius:7px; background:transparent; color:#F2D987; font-size:10px; font-weight:800; cursor:pointer; }\n  .chart-wrap { height:150px; padding:4px 0 0; }.chart-grid { stroke:#29465C; stroke-width:1; opacity:.65; }.chart-line { fill:none; stroke:#5AA7FF; stroke-width:3; stroke-linecap:round; stroke-linejoin:round; }.chart-area { fill:rgba(90,167,255,.12); }.chart-point { fill:#5AA7FF; stroke:#0E1D2C; stroke-width:3; }.chart-axis { fill:#8299A8; font-family:'JetBrains Mono',monospace; font-size:9px; }\n  .audit-list { display:grid; gap:0; }.audit-item { display:grid; grid-template-columns:26px 1fr auto; gap:10px; align-items:start; padding:12px 0; border-bottom:1px solid rgba(41,70,92,.62); }.audit-item:last-child { border-bottom:0; }.audit-icon { width:26px; height:26px; display:grid; place-items:center; border-radius:7px; background:#152A3D; color:#5AA7FF; }.audit-title { color:#E8F3F5; font-size:11px; font-weight:700; line-height:1.4; }.audit-meta { margin-top:4px; color:#718A99; font-size:10px; }.audit-time { color:#718A99; font-family:'JetBrains Mono',monospace; font-size:9px; }\n  .role-block { display:flex; align-items:center; gap:14px; }.role-bars { flex:1; display:grid; gap:8px; }.role-row { display:grid; grid-template-columns:80px 1fr 35px; gap:8px; align-items:center; }.role-name { color:#9FB2BE; font-size:10px; }.role-bar { height:7px; overflow:hidden; border-radius:999px; background:#152A3D; }.role-fill { height:100%; border-radius:999px; }.role-count { color:#E8F3F5; font-family:'JetBrains Mono',monospace; font-size:10px; text-align:right; }\n  .donut { width:92px; height:92px; flex:none; border-radius:50%; background:conic-gradient(#1BD1A5 0 67%,#5AA7FF 67% 82%,#E7B84B 82% 93%,#FF6870 93% 100%); display:grid; place-items:center; }.donut:after { content:''; width:58px; height:58px; border-radius:50%; background:#0E1D2C; }.donut-label { position:absolute; display:grid; place-items:center; color:#F6FBFC; font-family:'JetBrains Mono',monospace; font-size:12px; font-weight:700; }\n  .zone-table { width:100%; border-collapse:collapse; }.zone-table th { padding:9px 0; border-bottom:1px solid #29465C; color:#718A99; font-size:9px; text-align:left; text-transform:uppercase; letter-spacing:.12em; }.zone-table td { padding:11px 0; border-bottom:1px solid rgba(41,70,92,.62); color:#DCECEF; font-size:11px; }.zone-table tr:last-child td { border-bottom:0; }.zone-name { font-weight:700; }.zone-meta { margin-top:3px; color:#718A99; font-size:9px; }.zone-type { display:inline-flex; padding:4px 7px; border-radius:999px; font-size:9px; font-weight:800; }.zone-type.danger { color:#FF9BA0; background:rgba(255,104,112,.12); }.zone-type.caution { color:#F2D987; background:rgba(231,184,75,.12); }.zone-type.safe { color:#8BEBD4; background:rgba(27,209,165,.12); }\n  .state-examples { display:grid; grid-template-columns:repeat(3,1fr); gap:8px; margin-top:12px; }.state-card { min-height:88px; padding:11px; border:1px dashed #29465C; border-radius:8px; background:#0A1825; }.state-card strong { display:block; color:#DCECEF; font-size:10px; }.state-card span { display:block; margin-top:7px; color:#718A99; font-size:10px; line-height:1.4; }.state-card.loading span { color:#5AA7FF; }.state-card.empty span { color:#9FB2BE; }.state-card.down span { color:#FF9BA0; }\n  .toast { position:fixed; right:24px; bottom:24px; z-index:20; display:none; align-items:center; gap:9px; max-width:330px; padding:12px 14px; border:1px solid rgba(27,209,165,.5); border-radius:9px; background:#0E1D2C; color:#BFF5E8; font-size:11px; box-shadow:0 10px 28px rgba(0,0,0,.28); }.toast.show { display:flex; }\n  @media (max-width: 980px) { .admin-shell { padding:0 18px 32px; }.main-grid { grid-template-columns:1fr 1fr; }.main-grid .map-panel { grid-column:1 / -1; grid-row:1; }.main-grid .queue-panel { grid-column:1; }.main-grid .inspector-panel { grid-column:2; }.kpis { grid-template-columns:repeat(3,1fr); }.lower-grid { grid-template-columns:1fr; } }\n  @media (max-width: 620px) { .admin-shell { padding:0 14px 30px; }.admin-topbar { min-height:64px; }.brand-sub,.env-pill span:not(.env-dot) { display:none; }.top-actions { gap:6px; }.sync-pill { padding:0 9px; }.hero { display:block; padding:24px 0 18px; }.hero h1 { font-size:27px; }.hero-meta { margin-top:16px; justify-content:space-between; }.kpis { grid-template-columns:repeat(2,1fr); gap:8px; }.kpi { min-height:104px; padding:13px; }.kpi-value { margin-top:13px; font-size:21px; }.main-grid { display:flex; flex-direction:column; gap:10px; }.main-grid .map-panel,.main-grid .queue-panel,.main-grid .inspector-panel { width:100%; }.map-panel { min-height:0; }.map { min-height:300px; }.zone.safe { width:112px;height:112px; }.zone.caution { width:142px;height:142px; }.zone.danger { width:110px;height:110px; }.lower-grid { gap:10px; }.state-examples { grid-template-columns:1fr; }.panel-head { padding:15px; }.lower-body,.inspector-body { padding:14px 15px; }.toast { right:14px; left:14px; bottom:14px; max-width:none; } }\n</style>\n<div class=\"admin-page\" data-kid=\"1\">\n    <div class=\"admin-shell\" data-kid=\"1-1\">\n        <header class=\"admin-topbar\" data-kid=\"1-1-1\">\n            <div class=\"brand\" data-kid=\"1-1-1-1\">\n                <div class=\"brand-mark\" data-kid=\"1-1-1-1-1\">\n                    <i data-kid=\"1-1-1-1-1-1\" data-lucide=\"shield-check\" height=\"20\" width=\"20\">\n                    </i>\n                </div>\n                <div data-kid=\"1-1-1-1-2\">\n                    <div class=\"brand-name\" data-kid=\"1-1-1-1-2-1\">\n                        SafeYatra\n                        <span data-kid=\"1-1-1-1-2-1-1\">\n                            AI\n                        </span>\n                    </div>\n                    <div class=\"brand-sub\" data-kid=\"1-1-1-1-2-2\">\n                        System administration\n                    </div>\n                </div>\n            </div>\n            <div class=\"top-actions\" data-kid=\"1-1-1-2\">\n                <div class=\"env-pill\" data-kid=\"1-1-1-2-1\">\n                    <span class=\"env-dot\" data-kid=\"1-1-1-2-1-1\">\n                    </span>\n                    <span data-kid=\"1-1-1-2-1-2\">\n                        DEMO / PRODUCTION-READY\n                    </span>\n                </div>\n                <div class=\"sync-pill\" data-kid=\"1-1-1-2-2\">\n                    <i data-kid=\"1-1-1-2-2-1\" data-lucide=\"database\" height=\"14\" width=\"14\">\n                    </i>\n                    <span data-dynamic=\"true\" data-kid=\"1-1-1-2-2-2\" data-name=\"queued offline count text\" data-reason=\"text updated when synchronization state changes\">\n                        18 queued offline\n                    </span>\n                </div>\n                <div class=\"avatar\" data-kid=\"1-1-1-2-3\" title=\"System Administrator\">\n                    SA\n                </div>\n            </div>\n        </header>\n        <section class=\"hero\" data-kid=\"1-1-2\">\n            <div data-kid=\"1-1-2-1\">\n                <div class=\"eyebrow\" data-kid=\"1-1-2-1-1\">\n                    Control plane · Nashik district\n                </div>\n                <h1 data-kid=\"1-1-2-1-2\">\n                    Keep the safety network aligned.\n                </h1>\n                <p data-kid=\"1-1-2-1-3\">\n                    Manage people, zones, policies and the audit trail behind every response. The local queue remains active while cloud services catch up.\n                </p>\n            </div>\n            <div class=\"hero-meta\" data-kid=\"1-1-2-2\">\n                <span data-kid=\"1-1-2-2-1\">\n                    Last sync\n                    <strong data-dynamic=\"true\" data-kid=\"1-1-2-2-1-1\" data-name=\"last sync timestamp text\" data-reason=\"text updated via synchronization status\">\n                        08:42 UTC\n                    </strong>\n                </span>\n                <span data-kid=\"1-1-2-2-2\">\n                    Build\n                    <strong data-kid=\"1-1-2-2-2-1\">\n                        v1.0.0\n                    </strong>\n                </span>\n            </div>\n        </section>\n        <section aria-label=\"System metrics\" class=\"kpis\" data-kid=\"1-1-3\">\n            <article class=\"kpi\" data-kid=\"1-1-3-1\">\n                <div class=\"kpi-label\" data-kid=\"1-1-3-1-1\">\n                    <span data-kid=\"1-1-3-1-1-1\">\n                        Active tourists\n                    </span>\n                    <i class=\"kpi-icon\" data-kid=\"1-1-3-1-1-2\" data-lucide=\"users\" height=\"16\" width=\"16\">\n                    </i>\n                </div>\n                <div class=\"kpi-value\" data-dynamic=\"true\" data-kid=\"1-1-3-1-2\" data-name=\"active tourists counter\" data-reason=\"number updated by dashboard stats script\">\n                    1,250\n                </div>\n                <div class=\"kpi-note\" data-kid=\"1-1-3-1-3\">\n                    Across 12 monitored zones\n                </div>\n            </article>\n            <article class=\"kpi critical\" data-kid=\"1-1-3-2\">\n                <div class=\"kpi-label\" data-kid=\"1-1-3-2-1\">\n                    <span data-kid=\"1-1-3-2-1-1\">\n                        Open emergencies\n                    </span>\n                    <i class=\"kpi-icon\" data-kid=\"1-1-3-2-1-2\" data-lucide=\"siren\" height=\"16\" width=\"16\">\n                    </i>\n                </div>\n                <div class=\"kpi-value\" data-dynamic=\"true\" data-kid=\"1-1-3-2-2\" data-name=\"open emergencies counter\" data-reason=\"number updated by dashboard stats script\">\n                    04\n                </div>\n                <div class=\"kpi-note\" data-kid=\"1-1-3-2-3\">\n                    3 critical incidents now\n                </div>\n            </article>\n            <article class=\"kpi critical\" data-kid=\"1-1-3-3\">\n                <div class=\"kpi-label\" data-kid=\"1-1-3-3-1\">\n                    <span data-kid=\"1-1-3-3-1-1\">\n                        Critical risk\n                    </span>\n                    <i class=\"kpi-icon\" data-kid=\"1-1-3-3-1-2\" data-lucide=\"shield-alert\" height=\"16\" width=\"16\">\n                    </i>\n                </div>\n                <div class=\"kpi-value\" data-dynamic=\"true\" data-kid=\"1-1-3-3-2\" data-name=\"critical risk counter\" data-reason=\"number updated by dashboard sta